efore you click into the Recognition of prior learning (RPL) component don&rsquo;t forget to read this article about &lsquo;How to get RPL certificates&rdquo;.</p>', 'Here, we are presenting 10 possible ways to shape your future in Australia through RPL training programs. ', NULL, NULL, '190421-050454_60864f1abfe19.jpg', 'i12.jpg', 'Best Ways RPL Can Shape Your Future In Australia', 'ways to shape your future in Australia through RPL training programs', 1, '2021-04-25 23:26:50', '2021-09-08 22:03:14'),
(13, 1, 6, 'Top 10 Well-Paid Engineering Job Sectors in Australia', 'well-paid-engineering-job-sectors-in-australia', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Well! You achieved a degree from an engineering university, or you got an <a href=\"https://itecounsel.com/rpl\">RPL certificate</a> in the Engineer industry. Now, you might be concerned about the jobs and your career. If you want to make the growth in your career, the first thing you need to know what type of vacancies are available in the Australian job markets. For a primary level job in this industry, has various opportunities for the freshers who have graduated recently from an engineering college? Moreover, there have lots of potential job sectors in the engineering industry.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">In general, most jobs in the engineering department require experienced and skilled candidates. Based on skills, the engineering job sectors are categorized. From the bottom line to the upper level, every engineering employment has an expected salary range. Some companies may even offer much more remuneration than your idea in this industry. Those are some specific positions that are not available to get hired without having years of experience. Thinking of all those engineering job areas has different promising pay and committed job security in Australia.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Here we will talk about some well-paid engineering jobs that have high demands in the Australian job professions.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>10 Best Well-Paid Engineering Job Sectors in Australia</strong></h2>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>1. Mine Engineer</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Job Context:</strong> The mining engineers are assigned to do technical support in the mining operations. Their main job involves mining construction projects for project supply procurements calculation, an anthology of mining ground, selection of mining tools and machinery, etc.</p>\r\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/Mine Engineer.jpg\" alt=\"Mine Engineer\" width=\"600\" height=\"360\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Before any mining project starts, Mining engineers estimate all the relevant capital and equipment of mining operations. They also record the informative report of supplies and reserves of capital. In the field, they are the priority supervisors to maintain trouble issues, improve productivity and control the cost efficiency in the mine set.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>The Approximately salary ranges (Yearly): AUD 85,000 (Initially) to AUD 170,000 (For late-career).</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>2. Petroleum Engineer</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Job Context:</strong> Petroleum Engineers are allocated for various retrieving oil and natural gas projects from beneath the earth\'s surface. Most petroleum engineers get the charge in oil retrieving companies, and the rest have the opportunities in the research Center or the universities as associate lecturers.</p>\r\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/Petroleum-Engineer.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Some engineers work in the field gesture and help to prospect terms of cost, human resources, work equipment on drilling/pumping sites. Others have tasks in construction operations to look after the outcome and create reports based on the overall site state.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>The Approximately salary ranges (Yearly): AUD 78,000 (Initially) to AUD 180,000 (For late-career).</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>3. Nuclear Engineer</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Job Context:</strong> Nuclear engineers are responsible for developing the analysis processes for the nuclear energy and radiation development projects. They do research, design atomic energy system, and oversee equipment development, testing, and reactor maintenance.</p>\r\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/Nuclear-Engineer.jpg\" alt=\"Nuclear Engineer\" width=\"600\" height=\"401\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">In addition, nuclear engineers are in the assessment part of nuclear technical performance, monitor the core application, nuclear experiment, and the optimizations of new methodologies by expertise.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>The Approximately salary ranges (Yearly): AUD 67,000 (Initially) to AUD 120,000 (For late-career).</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>4. Biomedical Engineer</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Job Context:</strong> Biomedical engineers play supportive roles in medical research and bioproducts. The primary job is to work as a team in the relevant field of study in chemistry. In addition, they have to work in different sub-fields tasks in the experimental practices, monitoring jobs, communicating with technical engineers, etc. Most experienced and skilled biomedical engineers engage in robotic surgery operations and other required medicine sections.</p>\r\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/Biomedical-Engineer.jpeg\" alt=\"Biomedical Engineer\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>The Approximately salary ranges (Yearly): AUD 50,000 (Initially) to AUD 90,000 (For late-career).</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>5. Aeronautical Engineer</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Job Context:</strong> Aeronautical engineers usually work for the government defence ministry. For any specific security clearance, an aeronautical engineer needs special access, which the government provides. They mainly work on aerospace design and oversee aircraft, missiles, and satellite development. They also maintain confidential projects, others security, and functional tasks and assign for any prototype test.</p>\r\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/Aeronautical Engineer.jpeg\" alt=\"Aeronautical Engineer\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>The Approximately salary ranges (Yearly): AUD 62,000 (Initially) to AUD 115,000 (For late-career).</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>6. Industrial Engineer</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Job Context:</strong> Most industrial engineers serve in the manufacturing and environmental industries. Industrial engineers are hired to utilize the lower line workers for any manufacturing development process, improving machinery and other resources operation in proper analysis. They need to adopt various strategies to make more efficient production and create new forms of components to work in their proficiency.</p>\r\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/Industrial-Engineer.jpeg\" alt=\"Industrial Engineer\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>The Approximately salary ranges (Yearly): AUD 47,000 (Initially) to AUD 105,000 (For late-career).</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>7. Quantity Surveyor Engineer</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Job Context:</strong> A quantity surveyor engineer handle multitasks on different clients and the production sector as a quality controller. They consider construction and engineering cost consultants for different clients. From the position of a quantity surveyor, they are referred for project manager in a big manufacturing company for quality and quantity assurance.</p>\r\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/Quantity-Surveyor-Engineer.jpg\" alt=\"Quantity Surveyor Engineer\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>The Approximately salary ranges (Yearly): AUD 57,000 (Initially) to AUD 103,000 (For late-career).</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>8. Production or Plant Engineer</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Job Context:</strong> A production and plant engineer works in a management and supervisory position for the manufacturing plant operations. They work on the construction of a new product and do plant functions to ensure quality. The plant manager maintains the facilities of quality control, design, logistics, and maintenance of the product standards.</p>\r\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/Production-or-Plant-Engineer.jpg\" alt=\"Production or Plant Engineer\" width=\"600\" height=\"337\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>The Approximately salary ranges (Yearly): AUD 76,000 (Initially) to AUD 110,000 (For late-career).</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>9. Civil Engineer</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Job Context:</strong> The initial responsibilities of a civil engineer are to do plan, design, managing construction projects and other repairing jobs in construction. They do analysis, survey, and complete the activities with professional architectures. Civil engineers do model work on various building industries and also for government development businesses and workshops.</p>\r\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/Civil-Engineer.jpg\" alt=\"Civil Engineer\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>The Approximately salary ranges (Yearly): AUD 76,000 (Initially) to AUD 110,000 (For late-career).</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>10. Mechanical Engineer</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Job Context:</strong> A mechanical engineer engages in various communication duties, like developing, making, designing, and testing new or existing mechanical devices. Based on multiple projects, they have an essential role in using their skills to perform manufacturing equipment and industry-related technical missions.</p>\r\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/Mechanical Engineer.jpg\" alt=\"Mechanical Engineer\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>The Approximately salary ranges (Yearly): AUD 77,000 (Initially) to AUD 108,000 (For late-career).</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></h2>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Nothing is easy to achieve in the job sector, and you can\'t even jump into the highest-paid job without having zero experience. Now all you need to know is which position you are capable of and can bloom your career. From the upper discussion, you will learn about some best-paid job categories in the Engineering sectors. In Australia, those are the highest-paid work for an engineering background.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'two-colleagues-factory_60c73c7eed912.jpg', 'WhatsApp Image 2021-06-14 at 5.18.56 PM_60c73c7eed912.jpg', 'Well-Paid Engineering Job Sectors', 'Well-Paid Engineering Job Sectors in Australia', 1, '2021-06-14 03:24:47', '2021-09-08 21:58:08'),
(14, 1, 4, 'How an RPL Assessment Works that can Build a Bright Future in Australia', 'how-an-rpl-assessment-works-that-can-build-a-bright-future-in-australia', '<p>If you are thinking of making outstanding growth in your career into a suitable sector, several options are available in Australia. So, let\'s make it easier for you to understand to build your most secure and relievable future in Australia. One of the best and easiest methods is getting a Recognition of Prior Learning (RPL) certificate through your qualifications and performed skills based on your eligibility. From an assessment program of RPL, anyone can make a possible career without any degree or educational certificate.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>But the fact is most of them don\'t have much idea about how to do the valuation to get an RPL certificate. So many of them afraid to apply for a certificate assessment program and fail to get a good job in Australia. With all that issues, we will have a brief discussion on how to make the assessment in the RPL program and build a bright future through RPL. Along with that, let\'s talk about some quarries and questionaries on RPL/skills assessment tools in Australia.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><strong>What is an RPL assessment program?&nbsp;</strong></h2>\r\n<p>As we know, the <a href=\"https://itecounsel.com/rpl\">Recognition of Prior Learning (RPL)</a> program is an assessment training program based on skills, qualifications, and working experiences. Let\'s say, for example, RPL is a total package system for an experienced worker, and it gives the most possibilities chance to have a great deal in the Australian job market.</p>\r\n<p>Anyone can apply for this RPL assessment if he/she is eligible and have legit working experience or knowledge in real life.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><strong>What are the requirements needed for the RPL assessment tests?&nbsp;</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Before applying for an RPL certification test, you must know the requirements of what is vital for getting an RPL. Several zones are available to submit an RPL. Now the choice is where you can put yourself in this skills assessment test.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Make sure to provide the required and relevant paper files that are mentioned in the individual form.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Specified working experience, and proven documents (Based on which sector you want to earn the RPL)&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Now compiling to submit your best portfolio such as previous qualifications, any bachelor or relevant degree (If any), job references, work-line photos, and videos, and most importantly, your updated resume, etc.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>The recommendation letter of an authorized agent and all the government-certified attached files.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>All those requirements are important to pass the assessment tests, but some other documents can be required if necessary.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><strong>How to apply the skill assessment and training for the RPL certificates?&nbsp;</strong></h2>\r\n<p>At first, you need to decide in which sector you want to develop your work line. Next, collect all the necessary papers and documents to fill up the RPL assessment form. After Submitting all the papers, it will take more or less seven working days for checking up by the certified agents or representative.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>When the evolution is done, the evaluator ensures all the components that are important regarding an applicant\'s information. If there are any quarries, then the RPL form is sent back to the candidate to make the correction carefully. After the correction, again, the form needs to resubmit. Next, there is a recognition interview arrange for each candidate.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>After evaluating all the compile records, RTO arranges for a face-to-face or an online introduction season for the students at a suitable time and date. Sometimes participants need to go through a written test too. Following the process, all the steps need to pass, and some authorities may ask for a final interview when you got the result and become eligible for the right owner of an RPL. The institution where you applied will give a terminal confirmation letter to the agent. It takes two weeks to get the hard copy and collect it from the agent from where you do the process.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Note:</strong>&nbsp;The certified student agents of Australia lead all the administrative support for paper enrolment, payment, other recommendations (if required), quarry of certificates and statements, and further updates.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><strong>How to progress an RPL qualification step by step?&nbsp;</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Depending on your prior learning and previous working involvement, you can pick up an appointment for an RPL certificate. For 1/2 years, an experienced candidate will be eligible to get Diploma-level certificates, and if you have more sustainable qualifications, you can apply for the RPL certificates II, III. There are other considerations to update the level of your certificate to the professional level.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Usually, those certificates are provided by evaluating candidates\' skills and knowledge; that\'s why clients need to have more reviewing evidence and updated portfolios. The currency and payment may also vary the situation, and it will give some proficiency on RPL assessment certificates. Some other qualifications greatly influence getting advanced RPL certificates, like no criminal records, natural job experience, volunteer works, and formal and informal skill training. Demonstration of the knowledge and skills will build up a good impression of the RTO institution and allow you to step forward for the RPL assessment. There is no traditional system of study to make any progression to get an RPL, and you need to focus on the presentation of your file.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>From the ITEC Aus, you will get the best and most proper consultation on updating your portfolio and making progress in Australia\'s career.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><strong>Last words&nbsp;</strong></h2>\r\n<p>You will always find out some tricky benefits and long-term working facilities of an RPL assessment program. With all the purposes of the skill assessment, nothing is up to the loss, but you will get more and more confident to apply those terms in the job life. In this article, every major quarry on RPL have been presented and given possible solution for all the questionaries. Now ITEC Aus (International Training &amp; Educational Counsel, Australia) is one of Australia\'s iconic and most successful counsel Center. They always ready to provide you with the best RPL services and maintain an easier process for all the categories of RPL assessment within your best price. So, click and visit our RPL section for a clearer vision of RPL assessment.</p>', 'You will always find out some tricky benefits and long-term working facilities of an RPL assessment program. With all the purposes of the skill assessment.', 'RPL assessment works', 'RPL assessment works', 'successful-happy-business-team 2_60c97fc325949.jpg', 'WhatsApp Image 2021-06-15 at 6.24.37 PM (1)_60c97fc325949.jpg', 'How an RPL Assessment Works that can Build a Bright Future in Australia', NULL, 1, '2021-06-15 20:36:19', '2021-09-08 21:54:07'),
(15, 1, 9, 'The 10 Best Tips and Tricks for IELTS Preparation For You', 'best-tips-and-tricks-for-ielts-preparation-for-you', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">If you are thinking of studying abroad, you must know that having a good score is very important. No matter how valuable degrees or positions you are holding, you can\'t apply for a visa without earning an International English Language Testing System (IELTS) certificate. Even a job holder needs to hand over an IELTS paper with a standard grade. So, it is best to construct yourself with the preparation if you are planning to visit a foreign country. There are several steps to follow before you participate in the IELTS exams.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">First, you have to go through the registration process to participate in the test. Many students\' agencies may offer to join in the learning classes, and they will provide the best guidance before you jump in the exams. But still, you have to prepare yourself, and here we will give you some broader ideas about how to get a good score in IELTS with some easy tips and tricks.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>10 Best Tips and Tricks for a Good Score on the IELTS Exam:</strong></h2>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/tips-on-ielts-reading.jpg\" alt=\"tips on ielts reading\" width=\"700\" height=\"467\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong> </strong></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>1. Set goals with IELTS preparation</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Before you start to think of doing IELTS, it\'s better to set your mind full of determinations. If you want to score for a primary grade, you do not need to be ready for an advanced study. Now set a study time for vocabulary regularly. Practice speaking and reading every day for at least one hour. Usually, the IELTS exam is held every month of a year via student council agencies. So, you should set up the preparation time according to the capacity.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong> </strong></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>2. Use some Choosy words</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Examiners love to read your ideas and different types of words to define your creative mind in the exam. There is an easy trick to write your essay with some mesmerizing words. With this proportion, you will see your writing skills are getting improved, and your content creates a fantastic vibe for the reader. You can find some choosy words by googling and try to learn all of them.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/tips-on-ielts-writing.jpg\" alt=\"tips on ielts writing\" width=\"700\" height=\"467\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong> </strong></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>3. Writing tips- Focus on the word spelling</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">It is best to remember how to spell any words. One of the best techniques is pronouncing a word first then spell it. Always try to spell the words correctly. No matter how difficult a word is, you can find this way very easy to spell. For that, you can use a subtitle to watch any English movies or read any English paragraph by spelling each word.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong> </strong></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>4. Avoid writing wrong answers unless you are not confident</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Write your answer correctly, and if you don\'t know any explanations of the question papers, then it is best to leave it blank. As you know, there is a minus marking system for every wrong answer, which can low your score on a writing test. So, it is better to leave any reply unless you are not confident enough.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong> </strong></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>5. Speaking tips- Try to be chatty, not smart</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Remember, an examiner doesn\'t expect a business talk or formal conversation from you while taking a speaking test. Become a talkative one and start the conversation with a usual approach. You can use familiar vocabulary and avoid complex grammatical components (Words, Verbs, tenses). Speak quite simply but try to be more fluent and not to apply any phrases. Start an informal conversation rather than formally giving the speech but be respectful with the examiner.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/tips-on-ielts-speaking.jpg\" alt=\"tips on ielts speaking\" width=\"608\" height=\"405\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong> </strong></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>6. Listening tips- Managing time more effectively</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Take some time to concentrate and unleash your ability to improve the skull in the exam venue. Read the questions carefully before you start listening to the records and sentences. You will get less than a minute so utilize that time to find keywords and understand the questions. Always look forward to the upcoming questions (the first one and the second one).</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong> </strong></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>7. Identify the keywords</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Memorizing key points or lines will give you an extra advantage to find the correct answer. On a paper-based exam, you can highlight the keys and skip the unnecessary parts. So that while you will listen to the recording, you can quickly know which options need to check up. One more thing, pay closer attention to the keywords of the common questions. It is an easier way to restore the answers.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong> </strong></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>8. Concentrate and memorize for the computer-based exam</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">It will be challenging to memorize the wrong answer, but you will get a more accurate answer by omitting the wrong answers from the brain. On a paper exam, you can cross the wrong answers or unnecessary items by using your pen. Based on that, you must acknowledge all the incorrect portions in the computer-based exam to set the correct answer.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/tips-on-ielts-listening.jpg\" alt=\"tips on ielts listening\" width=\"700\" height=\"467\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong> </strong></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>9. Prepare for the questions you have to face</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Be prepared for three types of tasks where you need to read and focus a lot to participate in a writing test. Given below.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Multiple choices (Choose the best answer)</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">General questionaries (Introductory, completing the sentence, translation, fill in the blanks, etc.)</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Essay writing (Base on topics, case studies).</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong> </strong></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>10. Development of vocabulary and grammatical</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Better to add indefinite units of words while you are answering or writing an essay. Learn new words and synonyms to make the Writing more interesting. Always predict to choose creative words rather than to construct a sentence with a simple one. Never miss focusing on singular and plurals nouns because, in most cases, the wrong interpretation of nouns can lead to grammatical mistakes. Try to develop more in the English vocabulary and participate in the mock tests before the IELTS test.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></h2>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">We discussed some killer tips proven to make standard grades in Writing, speaking, listening, and reading tests. Also, other hidden tricks are available to improve your IELTS skills quickly. IELTS score doesn\'t measure only the writing and speaking skills but also helps polish your overall English skills under one package. That\'s why it is vital to have handsome marks before applying to a foreign country for study purposes or immigration. Learn more about one of the best <a href=\"../../ielts\">IELTS agencies</a> in Australia.</p>', 'Want to see a good score in the IELTS? Here, we are disclosed some of our easy tips and tricks to prepare for the IELTS tests in reading, writing, listening. Click to learn more for tips and tricks for the IELTS exam.', 'Tricks and trips, IELTS, Study abroad, ITEC', 'Tricks and trips for IELTS', 'education-concept-student-studying-brainstorming-campus-concept-close-up-students-discussing-their-subject-books-textbooks-selective-focus_60cacccb33060.jpg', 'WhatsApp Image 2021-06-16 at 6.06.04 PM_60cacccb33060.jpg', 'Tips and Tricks for IELTS Preparation For You', 'Best Tips and Tricks for IELTS Preparation For You', 1, '2021-06-16 20:17:15', '2021-09-08 21:49:11');
INSERT INTO `blogs` (`id`, `action_user`, `blog_categories_id`, `blog_title`, `blog_slug`, `blog_des`, `meta_des`, `meta_tags`, `meta_keys`, `image`, `thumbnail`, `image_alt`, `thumbnail_alt`, `isPublished`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(16, 1, 4, 'Top 10 Job Sectors for Business Background Students in Australia', 'top-10-job-sectors-for-business-background-students-in-australia', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">If you have completed your graduate program in business or you have an RPL certificate in business administration. Then getting a job in Australia is a most effortless fact for you. Especially for the business background students, there has plenty of choices and job sectors in the field of management. Many companies offer those graduated students and <a href=\"../../../rpl\">RPL (Recognition of Prior Learning)</a> holders for the business industry job with a good salary. Compared to the 24% of business students, nine percent of students get full-time management-level jobs, and the rest are in the sale provisions or work as an admin executive and in other fields.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Usually, a fresh business student doesn\'t get a high-paid position immediately after completing a bachelor\'s degree. They need to go through skills developments and build up management\'s ability to hold a consistent growth in the career. If you already have enough degrees and skills assessment certificates, you can get higher positions in the top management level with an outstanding remuneration. Further, you will describe the top ten available jobs for business study students in Australia. So, read the full article, and learn more about the business management jobs.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Best Career Sectors for Business Study Students</strong></h2>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">There has no binding to divert your career to a different sector. For the student in Business school administration, they have multiple opportunities to split into other job areas. Now here we short our list and give some key professions where you can have a tremendous career as a business student.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/Job Sectors for Business Background Students in Australia.jpg\" alt=\"Job Sectors for Business Background Students in Australia\" width=\"613\" height=\"409\" /></p>\r\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<h3><strong>Professor/Lecturer in Academic Institution:</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Nowadays, many students choose the teaching profession after completing their Bachelor\'s degree. As a business study student, you can be a teacher also in other educational institutions. All you just need to have a good CGPA, and a Ph.D. holder can apply for the position of a professor in universities in a particular subject.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Business Counselor:</strong></h3>\r\n<p>One of the leading job professions is a business counselor for bachelor students. This profession is about identifying, solving problems, and lead the assigned tasks to the best of the clients. Another role is to analyze the data of the client\'s budget, work performances, data collection and provide the best suggestions for business growth. For entry-level posts, only a bachelor\'s degree is required in particular subjects. However, some industries may have specific certificate requirements.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Entrepreneur:</strong></h3>\r\n<p>It is not mandatory to get a job in the business-related sectors as a business student. Even you can start your own or take part in the family business as a founder or co-owner. Build-up the entrepreneurs is the ultimate goal for the business study program. You can manage to make the best decisions and bloom a new or existing business with the modern educational degrees in Australia.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong> </strong><strong>IT Management:</strong></h3>\r\n<p><strong> </strong>You might be wonder how a business-related student will get fit in the IT sector. Well, in these recent days, people from the IT industry depend on business sales and administrational activities. For that\'s why in this industry, people are getting hired in the management departments. Business knowledge is needed to upgrade the values in the Australian Information Technology (IT) sector.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/IT-Management.jpg\" alt=\"IT Management\" width=\"588\" height=\"392\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Human Research Manager:</strong></h3>\r\n<p>As the industries are increasing and the new employees are getting employments in various sectors. That\'s why the post of an HR manager is now very demanding in every industry. People from the business management department are mainly receiving the offer for this job. So, this career is a very suitable and well-paid job to adopt for business students if you have a bachelor\'s degree in Human Resource Management (HRM).</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Business Development Executive:</strong></h3>\r\n<p><strong> </strong>Mainly, this particular side requires business studies students to form up the work lines. From marketing to business sales, all are done by the business school students in a trading site. Making a business proposal to business administration parts are operating by them. Now, in Australia, every small and giant companies employ business developers from a business background.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong> </strong><strong>A career in advertising and Media:</strong></h3>\r\n<p>In Australia, the media and advertising sectors are doing a very outstanding performance in business. This industry has an open place for creative people. That\'s why Business study\'s students are getting influences to show their creativity in this sector. Along with that, advertising and media agencies are involving in business analysis and marketing research, for that business graduates are the most valuable human resource. Also, if you have any specialties and experiences, you are welcome in such a working environment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/advertising and Media.jpg\" alt=\"advertising and Media\" width=\"576\" height=\"384\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Product and Supply-Chain Manager:</strong></h3>\r\n<p>This position was used to reserve for Bachelor\'s degree in science. But as this sector got a massive diversity in its business model. Companies are hiring and encouraging business students to embrace this job framework with the concepts of product quality maintenance and more manufacturing efficiencies. To build a more successful business in such an industry, the knowledge of the company is now very effective and more result-oriented.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>A career in Finance and Accounting: </strong></h3>\r\n<p>If you did your bachelor\'s or master\'s degree in finance and accounting, hundreds of job contexts are waiting for you to develop your career. In Australia, the position of Account managers and financial analysts has a considerable demand in the business job market. There are many operational and administration employments windows to jump into a fine career regarding the two subjects.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Operations and Project Manager:</strong></h3>\r\n<p><strong> </strong>Operation and project managers are the key persons to participate in the business activities. All the business curriculums are observed under the operation managers, and project managers are responsible for making the discrete tasks start and finish. So, business management students get the prime role to involve in this industry.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></h2>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Recently, in every industry, business background candidates are getting the appropriations in the job market. The Australian employment market has excellent stability, and people are getting job opportunities in business fields from many industries. So, using a bachelor\'s degree is a great initiative to build a brilliant career in Australia. Business Managers and entry-level jobs are all directed by the bachelor students. As a business student with job experiences and having the <a href=\"../../../rpl\">RPL</a> in business, it takes you one step ahead in the Australian job market.</p>', 'The golden opportunities are available for the business graduate student and business in RPL learner in multiple industries. Click to know more about the top 10 job sectors for the Bachelor\'s in Business Administration in Australia.', 'Job sectors for business student, business', 'Job sectors for business student', 'silhouette-confident-businesspeople_60e1b3971bffb.jpg', 'WhatsApp Image 2021-07-04 at 7.05.04 PM (1)_60e1b3971bffb.jpg', 'Job Sectors for Business Background Students in Australia', 'Best Job Sectors for Business Background Students in Australia', 1, '2021-07-04 05:11:51', '2021-09-08 21:42:01'),
(17, 1, 4, 'Best 10 Ways to Boost Your Career Prospects While at University', 'best-ways-to-boost-your-career-prospects-while-at-university', '<p>Are you concerned about getting your first job? Or are you worried about how to boost your career after you complete the graduate program? Don\'t afraid too much in this matter. It is always best to prepare yourself one step ahead in the job race. Especially when you are a final year student and make sure that you have some component in your account to boost your upcoming days, some advanced preparations can smooth the journey in your job life.</p>\r\n<p>To get your dream job, you need to do some groundwork while you are a university student. For a graduate student, it is the high-time to gear up the ability to make yourself ready for the job world. So here we are going to provide some of the easy ways to boost your career prospects while you are an ongoing student at a university. Read out the rest of the blog for better judgment about the career perspective.</p>\r\n<h2><strong>10 Ways to Boost Your Career Prospects While at University</strong></h2>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/Best Ways to Boost Your Career Prospects While at University.jpg\" alt=\"Best Ways to Boost Your Career Prospects While at University\" width=\"700\" height=\"467\" /></p>\r\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<h3><strong>Getting an RPL:</strong></h3>\r\n<p>If you have little working experience in any particular industry, then you will get a golden opportunity to shape your career with the <a href=\"https://itecounsel.com/rpl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">RPL qualification</a>. For the RPL holder, they are allowed to apply for any specialties sector with a high incentive. So, better not waste your valuable time and grab an RPL certificate for any of your particular choices.</p>\r\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<h3><strong> </strong><strong>Learn Short Courses:</strong></h3>\r\n<p>There are lots of short training courses available for the students who are undergraduates. For those students, such training courses are beneficial to grow their potentiality in any particular side. Anyone from any aged people can do those professional short courses. Some organizations offered free courses for undergraduate students to improve their skills before jump into the employment sector.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong> </strong><strong>Internship Program:</strong></h3>\r\n<p>One of the best and ideal ways to get the working environment is to take part in an internship program while completing your degree. It will be best if you can do your internship program in your relevant sector or industry. Sometimes, those company offers to give job facilities if you do well in the internship program. From such a program, you will get to get the taste of a working environment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong> </strong><strong>Doing Part-time Jobs:</strong></h3>\r\n<p>On the summer break or after your school, you can get a part-time job for your daily pocket money. But involving in jobs at an early age will help you to grip a line for a better future. Not just earning money should be the first priority, getting the working experience is a significant factor. Even a part-timer has a better opportunity to get a fixed job under the same roof.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong> </strong><strong>Diverse Your Networks:</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Attend university\'s career sessions and participate in various career counsel seminars for preparing yourself. Attending those programs can be a high turnover to boarder your reach and meet with new people. Make the communication to develop your timeline and build a social relationship with many organizational giants. As a result, you can come out with many professional references while applying for a job.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/Boost your carrier.jpg\" alt=\"boost your carrier\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" /></p>\r\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<h3><strong>Earn Soft Skills:</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Computer skills and other technical skills will give an excellent preference to the candidates in a specific sector. In these present days, having the soft skills on the computer is an advantage and holding the line you can make your career in a different industry. Skilled people are always welcome on those job sites. So, if you are interested in such a career, then developing your skills in a technology context will never let you be unemployed.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Be Punctual and Keep Your Resume Updated: </strong></h3>\r\n<p>An ideal student always remains punctual. No matter what keeping your regular routine as a student is essential to follow. Becoming a punctual student also means keeping discipline lines and practice your advanced skills daily. An important thing before you applying for any job, make sure you always keep updated your resume with the latest information because you never know when an opportunity will knock you.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong> </strong><strong>Participate in the Voluntary\'s Role:</strong></h3>\r\n<p>One of the primary stages to prepare for the career build-up is to participate in a voluntary job. As a student, having any voluntary involvement will count as an honorable and respective achievement. Those indicate the quality of a student\'s discipline and punctuality terms. Adding such accomplishment into your portfolio is a matter of great apprehension to the real world.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong> </strong><strong>Learn Different Languages: </strong></h3>\r\n<p>It is really important to have good knowledge about English writing and fluency in speaking to get a better job. But if you have additional knowledge about different languages, then getting a marketing job or any other foreign job will be easier to get. Learning different languages is the most challenging task, but the benefits are still delightful in the future. Especially getting a migrate job will be simple.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong> </strong><strong>A Good Score in IELTS:</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Always remember having a good score in IELTS will carry a good impression in front of the interviewer. A reasonable IELTS quotation will give you preferences on board to build up or boost up one\'s career. Earlier we speak having good skill on fluent English writing and speaking will lead to the better job. So, anyone can do IELTS at any time; specifically, a university student can earn a good score before graduation, which will help to face any interview with confidence.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><strong>Last Words: </strong></h2>\r\n<p>From the upper discussion, we can say that student life is the best time to make some good preparation. More or less, all students need to get ready before jump into the career market, at least holding some good achievement into their hands. In this modern and dynamic world, having no skills will knock you down cause the competition is very high, and everyone always brings their best position on the ground. So, here we summarized some easy and best eight ways to boost your career prospects while you are at university or college.</p>', 'It is the high-time to gear up the ability to make yourself ready for the job world. So here we are going to provide some of the easy ways to boost your career prospects while you are an ongoing student at a university.', 'Career Prospects While at University', 'Boost Your Career Prospects', 'free-time-students-bachelor-s-campus-life-rhythm-five-friendly-students-are-walking_60ed2a9e6c890.jpg', 'WhatsApp Image 2021-07-13 at 11.39.48 AM_60ed2a9e6c890.jpg', 'Best Ways to Boost Your Career Prospects While at University', 'Best Ways to Boost Your Career Prospects While at University', 1, '2021-07-12 21:54:39', '2021-09-08 21:34:32'),
(19, 1, 4, 'Top 10 Tips for Choosing and Applying to The Right RPL Course in Australia', 'tips-for-choosing-and-applying-to-the-right-rpl-course-in-australia', '<p>Are you looking to join in an RPL assessment qualification? And if you think you are eligible to get an RPL certificate with working experience. Then you might be wondered that how to start the process to get an RPL in Australia. Thinking of that, choosing the right RPL courses of your preferences is very difficult. You can\'t just rush to select anything for your future without having a proper thought. There should have some perspective to follow up in developing a career through choosing RPL qualification courses.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>So, before jump into the assessment program, you should be very careful to choose your demanding and suitable courses. By that, you don\'t have to face any dilemma, in the long run, to grow your career in Australia. In this context, you will get to know some easy tips for choosing the right RPL courses and applying to the assessment program.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><strong>Best Tips to Choose and Apply for the Right RPL Courses </strong></h2>\r\n<p>It will waste if you don\'t manage to find out or failed to use the right way to get the Recognition Prior Learning (RPL) qualification. To know more about the best courses that will sharpen your career in Australia, then the following part will help you acknowledge the easy tips for choosing and applying for an RPL.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>1. Eligible to apply for an Assessment</strong></h3>\r\n<p>First of all, you might need to confirm your qualifications. The industry you are going to use for an RPL, whether you are capable or not. If you don\'t have such qualifications or prior working experience, then it will be a total waste for you to apply. So, know the requirements on the particular section before attempting to apply one.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>2. Submit one RPL application per course:</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Don\'t act smart or try to trick in application submission. You are allowed to submit an application for different <a href=\"https://itecounsel.com/rpl\">RPL qualification courses</a> at a time, but that doesn\'t mean you can apply multiple applications for one particular course too. If you dare to do such a trick, you may end up getting the rejection or may be banned for using again.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>3. Go through the website for information</strong></h3>\r\n<p>To extend the RPL certifications, many Registered Training Organization (RTO) are ready to provide the RPL qualification services in Australia. You will find out all the relevant data and information regarding the RPL assessment program, Industries details, and specifications of diploma/certificate I, II, III courses on their official website.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>4. Choose course creditability</strong></h3>\r\n<p>If you are eligible to apply for more than one RPL industry, it will be wise to apply for the priority one. Choosing the subject or courses is a vital part of the RPL assessment program. So, having various industrials working experiences can open multiple doors for you to select one of your best creditability courses based on your interest.</p>\r\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/tips-for-applying-the-right-rpl-course-in-australia.jpg\" alt=\"tips for applying the right rpl course \" width=\"650\" height=\"434\" /></p>\r\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<h3><strong>5. Apply wisely with the industry you are fit in</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Suppose you were used to working for the construction industry, and now you are planning to apply your RPL assessment in the child career industry, which is not relevant. Usually, such a situation cannot get approval for RPL certifications. You may have a little bit of experience, but it is wise to go on the right path of your career to bloom in the connected industry.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>6. Thinking of your career prospects</strong></h3>\r\n<p>You may have some dream job to get or have any particular goal to shine in your career. Thinking of a career perspective, you really need to know which industry, what positions and why you are taking part in this qualification program. Focusing on the career perspective, apply for the suitable courses under the policy.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>7. Understand the RPL requirements and limitations</strong></h3>\r\n<p>One may consider the necessary steps to earn an RPL certificate. There are four easy steps to follow in the assessment program. First, participate in free skills assessment, provide authentic portfolio, get skilled checking, and get qualified. Now considering the limitations, you may have to abide by the rules and procedures to maintain for achieving a certificate.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>8. Avoid the same portfolio on multiple applications</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Once you applied for an application, your data records in the institution\'s database. So, if you apply for numerous RPL with the same information, it might not be great to get a good impression from the RTOs. You can use basic information but try to put different portfolio and working details for each application.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>9. Submit actual documentation and certificates</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Always use authentic documents for applying for the RPL accredited qualification. Those papers are strictly examined whether it\'s genuine or not and do individual skilled checking. On the other hand, the use of fake documentation can be caused you to become part of an illegal crime, which can be a severe problem in Australia.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>10. Get help from the student council agency</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Having problem with choosing RPL courses? Or facing any problem with the RPL application? One of the recommended solutions is to take the help from a student consultant and let an experienced student counsel agency handle your RPL paper for more accuracy. You may find many student agencies in Australia, but please hand over your information to the most reliable agency.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><strong>Conclusion: </strong></h2>\r\n<p>Let\'s say, for example, you applied for an RPL qualification and got rejected continuously, which may be unbearable to describe. So, if you don\'t want to face such situations, it\'s better to follow those easy tips given in the upper discussion. An RPL assessment program isn\'t a difficult task to succeed in, but following those tips will increase your chance to earn an RPL. It will smooth the road to achieving your dream career through the accredited qualification of RPL in Australia.&nbsp;</p>', 'Are you looking to join in an RPL assessment qualification? In this article, we discuss about Top 10 Tips for Choosing and Applying to The Right RPL Course in Australia.', 'Tips for Choosing and Applying to The Right RPL Course in Australia', NULL, 'Tips-to-Choose-and-Apply-for-the-Right-RPL-Courses-60feae14f2d3e.jpg', 'Tips for Choosing and Applying to The Right RPL Course in Australia_60feae14f2d3e.jpg', 'Choose the Right RPL Courses', 'Tips for Choosing and Applying to The Right RPL Course in Australia', 1, '2021-07-26 04:44:05', '2021-09-08 21:30:55'),
(20, 1, 6, 'How to Start a Bakery and Steps to Open a Bakery Business in Australia', 'how-to-start-a-bakery-and-steps-to-open-a-bakery-business-in-australia', '<p>You love to make cakes and all the cookery items for your family. Now considering the current situation of Australia, you might think of starting something to support your family or to make an easy live hood in Australia. Now, you want to hit a try on your passion for your profession. But without have any knowledge about cookery or bakery business, you might cause a dilemma and not get encouraged to <a href=\"https://business.gov.au/guide/starting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">open a business in Australia</a>.</p>\r\n<p>So, here we assist you with some ideas in the following statement about how to start a bakery business and what are the initial steps to maintain under the law and terms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><strong>What are The Steps to Start a Bakery Business?</strong></h2>\r\n<p><strong><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/blobid1\" alt=\"steps to start a bakery business\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" /></strong></p>\r\n<h3><strong> </strong><strong>Do Market Research</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Always best to do the ground research on the bakery demands and understand this business\'s environment. Your first step is to perform some market research on competitors, which will help to see a clear picture. Depending on the next part of business planning, it will help to carry out more flexibilities.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong> </strong><strong>Establish a Business Plan</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Nothing can be executed without developing the establishment of a business plan. So, after doing research, you should make some decorations and active budget plans based on the business demand. Your plan should be applicable or gets accepted within the time.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong> </strong><strong>Arrange the Start-up Capital</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Suppose you want to become a king of the best bakery proportion in Australia. Considering the budget planning, you may always need to get ready for making some expenses from the start-up investments. So, you may require enough self-capital or adding a bank loan to start your own bakery shop for smooth operation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong> </strong><strong>Register for the business</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Additionally, you have to apply for the registration and necessary permission to start any business in Australia. The Food Control Organization highly regulates state and local areas. As a result, it is highly required to get the permits letter before opening a new bakery. Collect all the key permissions under the local laws and regulations.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong> </strong><strong>Earn A Bakery License</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Having a bakery license is highly recommended to open a baker shop. There will need council approvals to monitor you and your business as well as to earn an operating food License. Getting an <a href=\"https://itecounsel.com/rpl\">RPL in Cookery and Bakery</a> will help you move forward in Australia\'s bakery business.</p>\r\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/bakery-business.jpg\" alt=\"bakery business\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" /></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong> </strong><strong>Understand Local Business Laws</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Don\'t adopt or take any unfair policies to harm the law and give proper respect to obey those. From state to state, the business strategy may vary depending on the local laws. So, before, hit the pin, know your area\'s rules and regulations, then start with the area observation from other local businesses.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong> </strong><strong>Select Venue for Physical Store</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Place is a big issue in this matter. By understanding, commercial needs choose a decent space and particular zone of high business, which will let you make an outstanding profit from the bakery business. Select your venue carefully because it will lead your business to demands.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong> </strong><strong>Pick The Category of Bakery</strong></h3>\r\n<p>One of the essential steps is to choose which types of bakeries you want to run. There are several bakery categories available, Bakery Caf&eacute;, Wholesale Bakery, Counter Service Bakery, Food Truck Bakery, and Home Bakery. So now, just choose one of the suitable types to start your bakery journey.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong> </strong><strong>Choose A Name for Shop</strong></h3>\r\n<p>After completing all the formal procedures, now it\'s time to give an attractive name to your business. Depending on the name, you have to impress your audience and encourage them to visit your bakery kingdom repeatedly. So, always choose the name wisely that really suits your business perspective.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong> </strong><strong>Emphasize Decoration Layout</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Let\'s begin planning the equipment you may need, organizing your kitchen, and doing the overall bakery cafeteria decoration. It will be best to take advice from an interior designer or someone with experience. But make sure to get an up-to-mark layout design that can influence more customers.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong> </strong><strong>Hiring and Polishing</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Now, make some room for the management team in your bakery business. If you got a home bakery service, you might not need to hire a bunch of people. But when you start a bakery in a place or a wholesale business, you have to employ capable people for individual tasks and sectors.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong> </strong><strong>Design The Menu Card and leaflet</strong></h3>\r\n<p>After decorating the insider setup, now work on the menu and product list. Simply include all your possible items in the menu list and make some delightful menu cards with the detail of ingredients. If needed, hire a professional designer to design the menu card and all the other business greeting drafts.</p>\r\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/Start bakery business in Australia.jpg\" alt=\"Start bakery business in Australia\" width=\"700\" height=\"350\" /></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong> </strong><strong>Note A-List of Reserved Items</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Depending on the number of customers, you should follow a monthly chart to keep a reserve of the necessary items. Carefully note a list for monthly reserved groceries and bring them from the market. Use the stored items according to your needs; otherwise, you may run out of the items before the month-end.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong> </strong><strong>Prepare Detailed Bakery Designs</strong></h3>\r\n<p>If your business is entirely bakery, you primarily emphasize your creative bakery items. Then keeping details of bakery designs and formula should be in a safe locker. Prepared the advanced designs will help you to keep UpToDate for the work.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong> </strong><strong>Online Promotional Activities</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Nowadays, you can\'t grow any business with the traditional formats without using online stages. Especially, creative work has a great demand in social media. Making some promotional activities creates business pages and accounts on multiple platforms by the business name and logo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong> </strong><strong>An Opening Ceremony</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Arrange a grand opening of your business, and invite all your friends and family members to attend the opening ceremony. Make some first customer offers and discount for friends and family because it is best to start a new journey with some good wishes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><strong>Conclusion</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Holding the bakery talent and spear money won\'t be the best choice to keep in hand. Rather than that, use it in more special operations like opening a pastry shop or a bakery farm. You don\'t need to make ultra-fusion over the business method unless you are not good enough or can\'t give the best effort to start a bakery business. Don\'t hold back if you really want to start something great in the bakery business. Following the steps and rules, you can make an outstanding result in your <a href=\"https://itecounsel.com/hospitality-industry/industry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">business career</a>.</p>', 'Here we assist you with some ideas in the following statement about how to start a bakery business and what are the initial steps to maintain under the law and terms.', NULL, 'How to Start a Bakery and Steps to Open a Bakery Business in Australia', 'What-are-the-steps-to-start-a-bakery-business-6109176bb30f3.jpg', 'How to Start a Bakery and Steps to Open a Bakery Business in Australia_6109176bb30f3.jpg', 'What are the steps to start a bakery business', 'How to Start a Bakery and Steps to Open a Bakery Business in Australia', 1, '2021-08-03 02:16:11', '2021-11-01 09:18:34'),
(21, 1, 6, 'Importance of University and College Clubs for Students ', 'importance-of-university-and-college-clubs-for-students', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Academic time is one of the best times to prepare yourself as a student to prosper in the future. That time is compassionate and most pampering hours to make the lines between professional career or suffering in the long run. Now you have to choose which side you want to see after college/university graduation.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">From all those boring classes, seminars, and exams, you may find yourself depart from the community and social group of friends. Now, if you want to make some changes in your life, it is high time to engage in social or university clubs. Not just for getting quality time to pass, but also, those experiences will give an extra privilege in career improvements and milled opportunities for the lifetime.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">So, depending on your needs, you should choose one of your suitable clubs to polish and prepare for the future. Here, you will find out why the benefits of joining university/college clubs and the importance of those clubs for students?</p>\r\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/importance of university clubs.jpg\" alt=\"importance of university clubs\" width=\"501\" height=\"335\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Benefits of Joining Clubs in College or University</strong></h2>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><strong> </strong></h2>\r\n<h3><strong>1. Chance to Develop Your Skillset</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Along with your academic courses, adding some skills will give an additional aspect of personal development. Those sets of skills will give an extra point to apply for beginner jobs or internships. Perhaps you may begin to evaluate those career build-up skills from doing academic, social, sports clubs and will be able to expand your potentiality under pressure. Also, it will help you to create a high-profile with specialized ability.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\r\n<h3><strong>2. To Demonstrate Time Management</strong></h3>\r\n<p>One of the main reasons for joining clubs is to learn time management under pressure. From the club activities, you will gradually learn to demonstrate the tasks on time and learn how to meet the deadline. Because those club activities have serious management policy and all members, have to maintain the discipline lines. By getting involved in clubs as a student, you can earn the ability to manage your schedule of works within the time frame.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\r\n<h3><strong>3. Learn New Things</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Suppose you just joined a programming club, and you are started to know about the insights of the club functions. As a club member, you may assign to participate in new assignments daily. Thinking of that, you have a great scope to learn new things from all that tasks and also from other members. So, there are considerable opportunities to acquire knowledge on various things.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\r\n<h3><strong>4. Enriches Your Life as A Student</strong></h3>\r\n<p>To get a break from your regular college life, everyone should have an enjoyable taste of the student life from a club activity. Most students do not prefer club things as they think it will hamper their regular studies. However, if you can make a balanced life between academic and clubbing activities, you may get an outstanding result in the long run. Besides, clubbing things are very effective in growing enrichments inside the student.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>5. Experience Makes Resume Interesting</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Such organized activities will make a positive identity and lead a good impression for a fresh graduate for the resume. You can attach your club participation on various projects on your cv to impress the interviewers. Your club events will present your activations on the college ground and the extra-curricular involvement while you were a student. In some cases, you may be lucky to get your first job from such a multitasking ability.</p>\r\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/importance of joining clubs in college.jpg\" alt=\"importance of joining clubs in college\" width=\"471\" height=\"315\" /></p>\r\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\r\n<h3><strong>6. Boost Your Self-Confidence </strong></h3>\r\n<p>Research shows that assisting in a club will help you broaden your confidence level to one step ahead of an ordinary student. It will give you an awesome vibe into yourself at the work premises, or any event ground, or at the presentation time. Students who maintain the academic studies and club curriculums can build good self-confidence and self-assurance to face more challenges as they build their conviction shields from campus life.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\r\n<h3><strong>7. Earn Leadership Skills</strong></h3>\r\n<p>For an undergraduate student, it is easy to obtain confidence by practicing the leadership skills and let apply in the real world. Being a part of a student organization, you can learn how to monitor the members of the team activities and know-how to lead any event through your leadership skill? Having such commanding power from your prior college life will hold a good position and help organize professional networking and valuations.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\r\n<h3><strong>8. Enjoy Your University Life</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Why not just enjoy the days on your campus life? Club participation is meant to learn and achieve skills, but you will also get a thrilling adventure throughout the semesters from club actions. Enjoy the social gathering, event meeting, service activities, arrangement of tours all are the best part of a university club. Sharing your emotions, all that giggling, and efforts with your club members are also fun. As a team, you will get the best experience under team works.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\r\n<h3><strong>9. Opportunity for Networking </strong></h3>\r\n<p>The best advantage of joining a club is getting engaged with diverse people and learning their values and cultures. By this, you will find more and more opportunities in the future to make some good references. For getting a suitable job, networking is the easiest way. So, from your graduation days to the career period, you may get golden chances or job offers by participating in club events.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\r\n<h3><strong>10. Host and Representative skills</strong></h3>\r\n<p>From the social or industrial program arrangement, many club individuals get the chance to perform on the stage as the host or representative. Such soft skills will give a great highlight to your ability, and you may be able to focus on better outcomes in career polishing. If you can uphold your communication skills, getting a marketing or relevant job position will welcome you.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></h2>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Several benefits and opportunities are waiting for you immediately after the compilation of the university degree with an additional tag of a club member. Among the attribution of the clubs, you may find your passionate career and will be more beneficiary in the job sites.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">There are many important factors to consider, like, which club are you choosing? What are the club activities? How will such experience help <a href=\"Basic%20Role%20of%20An%20Accountant\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">get an RPL qualification</a>? There are the more important reasons for students to join university/college clubs. So, do not get late if you are not a part of a club yet.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>', 'You will find out why the benefits of joining university/college clubs and the importance of those clubs for students.', NULL, 'Importance of University/College Clubs for Students', 'Benefits-of-Joining-Clubs-in-College-or-University-610bf2824da7c.jpg', 'Importance of University and College Clubs for Students_610bf2824da7c.jpg', 'Benefits of Joining Clubs in College or University', 'Importance of University and College Clubs for Students', 1, '2021-08-05 06:15:31', '2021-09-08 21:20:37');
