(24, 1, 6, 'Top 10 Reasons Why You Should Study Accounting in Australia', 'why-you-should-study-accounting-in-australia', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">In this current world, Accounting is a significant subject matter for every industry. It is almost impossible to find any big corporations or enterprises without an accounting department. Even for small businesses, the proper accounting rules are being adapted for management or security purposes. Such exciting career options and job responsibilities are waiting for you if you really want to be an accountant. Nowadays, an accounting graduate will start a sharp career immediately after the graduation program ends.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">From studying accounting courses, adequately, you may find your best position in Australia. However, the country gives lots of finest destinations for pursuing higher education in the accounting field. Now think before you choose Accounting as your major subject, you may need to know why you should study accounting for a bright walk of life and what is the accessible path waiting for you? So, here are some key benefits that will make your accounting qualification worthy in Australia.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>What Is the Available Career as Accountants?</strong></h2>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Some of the typical job positions for accountants or accounting qualified students,</p>\r\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<li>Taxation officers</li>\r\n<li>Bankers</li>\r\n<li>Entrepreneurs</li>\r\n<li>Forensic Accountants</li>\r\n<li>Investment Managers</li>\r\n<li>Auditors</li>\r\n<li>Stockbroking Managers</li>\r\n<li>Research Associate</li>\r\n<li>Investment Analysts</li>\r\n<li>Financial Advisors</li>\r\n<li>Management Consultants</li>\r\n<li>Finance Management</li>\r\n<li>Business Analysis</li>\r\n<li>Professor in accounting</li>\r\n<li>Investment Advisory</li>\r\n<li>Risk Management Specialization</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/Why You Should Study Accounting.jpg\" alt=\"Why You Should Study Accounting\" width=\"600\" height=\"346\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>What is The Basic Role of An Accountant?</strong></h2>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">An accountant\'s primary considerations are giving financial advice or money rotations and preparing and settling the period\'s accounting records. Maintaining the accuracy in business financial terms, records, bills, taxes, and overall cost transactions are the part of the accountants. So, here are some other roles as an accountant is given below:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<li>Organize the company\'s financial records and all the other necessary accounting statement books.</li>\r\n<li>All the review statements on cash and accrual terms for more accuracy in the final accounting paper.</li>\r\n<li>Suggest and make some financial advice over the operating costs to reduce and increase revenues and profits.</li>\r\n<li>Financial Bookkeeping tasks and record the important note against the events.</li>\r\n<li>Make sure with records and statements to follow under the accounting law and country\'s financial rules.</li>\r\n<li>Calculate accrued taxes, prepare tax returns book, and ensure prompt payment considering the company\'s benefits.</li>\r\n<li>Inspect account books and accounting information systems to keep up to date.</li>\r\n<li>Provide auditing services under the company requirements and time-frames.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Benefits of Studying Accounting in Australia</strong></h2>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Vast Career Opportunities</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Considering the following career list, you already acknowledged the available accountant job in the career titles. In Australia, there are several positions open for an accountant where you can jump to shape your career. Without having any worries, you can build a professional lead in various standings in the finance department.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Scholarship in Financial Assistance </strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Most Australian universities offer undergraduate and postgraduate students for scholarship opportunities. By pursuing an accounting subject or degree, one can broaden the link with the partner nations. It helps to contribute to tuition fees, living expenses, airfare, and overall student health coverages. Even there are chances for them to get awarded and do part-time job opportunities to meet the financial burden.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/Basic Role of An Accountant.jpg\" alt=\"Basic Role of An Accountant\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Enjoy Career Flexibility </strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">There are huge flexibilities on most of the accountant jobs in Australia. As this is entirely a desk job and you don\'t need to make any physical effort to do the regular tasks. All you just need to do is brainstorm and do some study for the company\'s financial state. So, daily job compilation is not a big deal, and you can enjoy the favorable job loads too.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Graduate with An International Degree </strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Internationally financial accounting courses are certified all over the world. Studying graduate or postgraduate qualification in accounting has a great demand, and every country does the accounting practice under the terms and conditions. So, build an outstanding profession, lots of graduate students major in accounting as this is an international qualified degree.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Employment in Any Industry </strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">As you know, every industry has an accounting or finance department to maintain all the financial transactions of the particular sectors for a time frame. Every industry or business hires financial employees to keep relevant data and prepare the final report for each quarter and year. So, you will get a big chance to knock everywhere with your accountant degree.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Great Potential in AIS </strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Nowadays, accounting has become a great influencer for Accounting Information Systems (AIS) in business. Students are learning and taking cover in the modern technique of studying accounting. They are enjoying this accounting partition and applying it the real-life job requirements. Lots of significant opportunities are waiting for the potential AIS students in work-lines.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Good Salary Range </strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Accountants earn an above-average wage in Australia. The average salary is AUD 50-60,000 plus yearly from junior financial assistance to the financial advisor. Above that, the range is enormous for the senior advisor to financial controller and managers. The content goes up based on the work experience and job position in the finance department segmentally.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>High Demand and Secure Profession </strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">In Australia, every industry pursues accountants for their financial solutions and provides a good remuneration range under conditions. No matter what, this job is very secure and demanding as the manager can\'t cut the accountants on company\'s deficiency because they are the financial advisors. So, studying accounting may bring you a fortune for a long career.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Consultation with Less Mathematic Terms</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">One of the best parts of being an accountant is not to memorize all the formulas or heavy mathematic equations to finalize primary tasks and reports. More than crunching the number, an accountant needs to make analytical advice, bookkeeping tasks, and partial mathematic on business accounting components to break down.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Study Accounting via Online </strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">One can acquire an accounting qualification certificate from online study or courses from any authorized academy institution. Even in Australia, most of the Recognize Training Organizations (RTO\'s) provide the <a href=\"https://itecounsel.com/rpl\">RPL course</a> on Certificates IV in Accounting and bookkeeping, which is very comfortable. You can earn the diploma certificate remotely.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Conclusion </strong></h2>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Studying accounting is not an easy-going part of an academic qualification. To get qualified as an accountant, you have to make some significant effort to study accounting. You have to know to have excellent knowledge about the rules and regulations to track all accounting transactions assigned by the industry. Though it is hard to complete graduation in accounting, a bright future is ahead when you get a qualified accounting degree and deal with real-life job life and individual involvements.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'top-10-reasons-why-you-should-study-accounting-in-australia.png', 'top-10-reasons-why-you-should-study-accounting-in-australia.png', 'Study Accounting in Australia', 'Why You Should Study Accounting in Australia', 1, '2021-08-16 05:31:12', '2021-09-08 21:02:57'),
(25, 1, 4, 'How RPL Building Course Helps to Grow Your Career with Success Stories', 'how-rpl-building-course-helps-to-grow-your-career', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Thinking of your comprehensive experience in the construction industry as a builder, you may have a certain quality to meet the client\'s needs. But having such experience won\'t last you to run long if you don\'t have such qualification certificates. Usually, it is pretty expensive and time-consuming to perform an academic degree in the building and construction subject at your age. Also, you may not be able to focus on the adequacy of study and the current profession. However, it\'s not late to make the changes on board. Your prior knowledge and skills will help to bloom your construction business. Moreover, it will help you to make career development and grow confidence in you as a builder.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Now getting a builder\'s license is a more straightforward process with some easier steps in Australia. You can convert your working knowledge into a nationally recognized qualification with an <a href=\"https://itecounsel.com/rpl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">RPL certificate</a> in the construction industry. Some of the RPL courses like CPC40110-Certificate IV in Building and Construction (Building) and CPC40508-Certificate IV in Building &amp; Construction (Site Management) are the main focus of are designed to accelerate along with your existing learning and training in the building industry. Go through the blog to understand how the RPL course will help you grow your career in the construction business and working industries by following the structural principles and legal obligations.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Some of The Common Reasons to Earn an RPL Qualifications</strong></h2>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Easy Assessment</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">With some easy steps, you can earn an RPL certificate in your preferable industry. All you just need to follow the 4/5 steps of the RPL assessment program. First, do a free skills assessment from an educational counsel agency, then submit evidence of prior experience, later skilled check by RTO, and finally get qualified.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Cost Friendly </strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">This accredited recognition learning program is very much cost-friendly than the formal qualification in industrial courses. With a standard amount of fee, you will be eligible to earn an RPL qualified certificate as a builder, which is much lower than the university\'s degree cost.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Minimum Experience </strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Anyone with minimum working experience can apply for an RPL certificate. At least 12 months of post-trade certificate experience is a number to qualify for certifications I and II in construction. Along with that, who has more experience will be certified with more advance RPL course qualification.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Save Time </strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The RPL qualification doesn\'t take much time to settle. If you go for a university degree or short diploma course in the building industry, it will take at least 3-4 years to complete. But getting an RPL qualification certificate within a week is enormous scope for you to save time.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Get Qualified in Weeks</strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Usually, the RPL assessment program is done by the RTO agency, and also, they do the rest of the procedure until you finally get your desire certificates. So, all you just need is to submit the required papers and documentation and wait for years...! Oh no, just for seven days to get qualified.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Easy Documentations </strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Depending on your prior learning and previous working involvement, you can pick up an appointment for an RPL certificate qualification. You have to submit the Evidence Portfolio, including an updated resume, reference letters, work examples/samples, photos/videos, certificates and transcripts, and overseas qualifications in construction industries.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Nationally Recognised Qualifications </strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">RPL accredited qualification is approved by the Nationally Recognised in Australia. The RPL providers are known as Registered Training Organization (RTO), who are doing active operations using the Australian Qualifications Framework. So, an RPL certificate will significantly value your career in the building and construction industry.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Enhanced Career Opportunities </strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">In this Covid situation, most educational institutions get closed off, and people cannot complete their graduate program in construction qualification courses. So, having an RPL will help you get qualified for the authentic qualification, and an RPL holder always prioritizes the job field over others.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Vast opportunities to Earn More </strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The more you qualify for the advanced level building and construction certificate, the more your expected salary will increase. With an advance certificate, you can grow your work line and get a promotion from worker to manager-level positions. That means it is an easy process to earn a better salary.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Get Certified while at Work </strong></h3>\r\n<p>You don\'t need to keep waiting for your RPL assessment program or to miss your regular work schedules. Just hand over the relevant documents and wait for the assessment tests. Even some trials are taken online. But in the case of the majority, you don\'t need to worry about your workflow.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Available RPL courses of Building and Construction Industries in Australia:</strong></h2>\r\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<li>CPC10111-Certificate I in Construction</li>\r\n<li>CPC20112-Certificate II in Construction</li>\r\n<li>CPC30111-Certificate III in Bricklaying- Block laying</li>\r\n<li>CPC30611-Certificate III in Painting and Decorating</li>\r\n<li>CPC31211-Certificate III in Wall and Ceiling Lining</li>\r\n<li>CPC31411-Certificate III in Construction Waterproofing</li>\r\n<li>CPC32011-Certificate III in Carpentry and Joinery</li>\r\n<li>CPC32413-Certificate III in Plumbing</li>\r\n<li>CPC40110-Certificate IV in Building and Construction (Building)</li>\r\n<li>CPC40508-Certificate IV in Building &amp; Construction (Site Management)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>RPL Diploma Courses:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<li>CPC50210-Diploma of Building and Construction (Building)</li>\r\n<li>CPC60212-Advanced Diploma of Building and Construction (Management)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Successors Stories of RPL in Building and Construction Industries;</strong></h2>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<table style=\"height: 332px; width: 101.167%;\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 49.5513%;\" width=\"301\">\r\n<h3><strong>&lsquo;Marko Jesic&rsquo;</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Just completed my cert 4 in building and construction. My instructor was unreal with his experience and knowledge in the building game. Classes were done through zoom meetings while at home, which made the experience even more enjoyable. Highly recommend this to anyone who is interested in furthering their career.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 49.5513%;\" width=\"301\">\r\n<h3><strong>&lsquo;Shane Loveridge&rsquo;</strong></h3>\r\n<p>I completed my certificate 4 in the building recently. Not only was it great to be able to complete my studies at home, but I was also able to do it at my own pace. Class being once a week via zoom and assessment times being flexible, it made it easy to fit this course into my week, which involves running my own construction company. My teacher always thoroughly explained things and would take the time to help with any queries outside of class too! Can highly recommend this course and the trainer without a second thought!</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><em>COURSE COMPLETED: CERTIFICATE IV IN BUILDING AND CONSTRUCTION (BUILDING)</em></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></h2>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">In Australia, many people are now adapting the RPL qualification as a vital element to grow their careers. Especially in the building and construction industry, it has a great demand among Australians. So, here we talk about the importance of the RPL building course that helps to grow your career as a builder. Furthermore, let&rsquo;s get to know <a href=\"../../blog/how-an-rpl-assessment-works-that-can-build-a-bright-future-in-australia\">how an RPL assessment works that can build a bright future in Australia.</a></p>', 'Go through the blog to understand how the RPL course will help you grow your career in the construction business and working industries by following the structural principles and legal obligations. ', NULL, 'How RPL Building Course Helps to Grow Your Career', 'how-rpl-building-course-helps-to-grow-your-career.jpg', 'how-rpl-building-course-helps-to-grow-your-career-with-success-storiesjpg.jpg', 'How RPL Building Course Helps to Grow Your Career', 'How RPL Building Course Helps to Grow Your Career with Success Stories', 1, '2021-08-21 23:47:59', '2021-09-08 20:20:57'),
(26, 1, 4, 'How to Network and Collaborate in The Community Services Sector?', 'how-to-network-and-collaborate-in-the-community-services-sector', '<p>Let\'s say, for example, you are a community service holder, and you are doing great in community supports under a social welfare organization. Now, thinking of a situation, you went to a refugee camp to work for disabled people or were assigned to work in vaccine providing campaign for a period.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Coincidently, when you arrived at the spot and saw the other members are your known faces, and you already accomplished one or two missions together a long ago. Then you will feel great to have someone familiar by your side. With those thoughts, let\'s say you went to a business trade conference. Now there you find the chairman of the company is one of your known persons who used to be an ally in a community service project. With that line, he may offer you the contract of the business for the sake of that service holder relation and the point on the same interest. A majority case shows one of the biggest networking sources is the community service industry. Building networks and communication can pull a bridge between mutual interests where they may get attached soon than the other ways. So, counting this part, this blog has been decorated to describe how to network and collaborate in the community services sector on practical life.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><strong>Why is Networking Important in The Community Services Sector? </strong></h2>\r\n<p>The Network includes the individuals or groups who work, share information and ideas, and require a resource to help the common objective for the welfare of communities. Networking in community services is described as creating efforts and making contacts with the people for providing social services under a community organization. There might behave different aspects of community service where build-in networks with other community\'s individuals and groups associate are easy and reliable for a common goal. Even networking may help you meet any financial or career focusing objects to full fill under the community services. That might be made it successful and more enjoyable to get participated in the community\'s favor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><strong>What Are The Ways to Network And Collaborate in The Community Services Sector?</strong></h2>\r\n<p><strong><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://img.freepik.com/free-photo/diverse-friends-using-digital-devices_53876-96880.jpg?size=626&amp;ext=jpg\" /></strong></p>\r\n<p>You may find some of the easiest ways to collaborate and network through the community services sector. Now thinking of the possible ways, you have to step out whether you are committed to the services for any other purposes or not. Here are some possible ways to inject your devoted mind to collaborate and build networking through the community services sector.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Participated in a community organization or to any social service centers.</li>\r\n<li>Take part in social events or charity campaigns to show your affections.</li>\r\n<li>Attend social welfare conferences and civil operations near your area.</li>\r\n<li>Try to be socialized in corporate events and talk with the people for social purposes.</li>\r\n<li>Keep connected through social media and communicate with other members of the organization.</li>\r\n<li>Arrange or invite the members for dinner as your guest at home if possible.</li>\r\n<li>Be present in the monthly or weekly meetings of the organization. Don\'t miss any of it.</li>\r\n<li>Open the knot of social problems and find solutions together with other community members.</li>\r\n<li>Take opinions and ideas from your co-members so that everybody can get performed and a chance to prove their social interests.</li>\r\n<li>Influence people or your nearest persons to get involved in community services; by this, you will get to know new faces.</li>\r\n<li>Never say no to any community trip. Added that, this is the most proven way to build networks, collaborate with service members, and construct a strong bonding between common interest people.</li>\r\n<li>Show your communication and adaptability skills to impress your other members. With this, you can introduce your position as an active member.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><strong>How Can You Get Started With Your Own Community Support?&nbsp; </strong></h2>\r\n<p>Now there is a distinct possibility to set up your community or social organization. For that, you might need to have some criteria to follow, and by aiding the government permission, you can pull a great initiative in your area to build a community with a few numbers of members.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>You have to find out what is needed in your community institution to build and grow.</li>\r\n<li>Considering the community law, don\'t do any operation that goes against the community or country laws.</li>\r\n<li>Be cautious about what ability you have or skills to prove as a community leader because running a community isn\'t a piece of cake.</li>\r\n<li>Be more attentive and focused on the project choice; never go for a big budget plan for start-up work.</li>\r\n<li>Develop a Plan according to your capacity, surrounding, and working capability.</li>\r\n<li>To start a community, you better Recruit your volunteers as per the project size. You can start with your family and friends.</li>\r\n<li>Make a budget for the assigned social welfare project.</li>\r\n<li>Maintain a Timeline to finish and make sure to evaluate for a smooth operation.</li>\r\n<li>Numbers of ways to raise money, or you can contact any local businesses for sponsorship.</li>\r\n<li>That is not bad to get public attention, but the main goal should be social well-being.</li>\r\n<li>Start your project on the planned way and keep rolling the working tasks without any delay.</li>\r\n<li>Keep everything in their phase, do the cleaning stuff, and let it be organized after the project is done.</li>\r\n<li>Make communications with the members and make some warm welcome functions for newcomers.</li>\r\n<li>Just follow the previous components and repeat the process for the next one.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Even community services help to create reciprocal relationships with other members of the organization and build a community connection with other groups or communities. That can concrete the way to bond and work together toward various solutions.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><strong>What Are the Principles of Collaboration and Networking in Community Support? </strong></h2>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://aspire-solidus-production.s3-ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com/assets/CXPRP001/samples/CXPRP001.pdf\"><strong>(Source)</strong></a><strong> </strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>All people are valued members of the community, and each person has something of value to contribute; participation is encouraged and valued.</li>\r\n<li>All collaborators should clearly understand their role, their responsibilities, and the goal of the activity.</li>\r\n<li>Working together to reach a common goal involves teamwork, good communication, and problem-solving.</li>\r\n<li>Feedback, suggestions, and reviews are encouraged and acted upon; information is shared (where appropriate), and decisions are made together.</li>\r\n<li>While all team members and collaborators should work together, individual ideas, opinions, and needs are respected and valued.</li>\r\n<li>The aim is to reach a clearly defined goal in the most effective way possible; this commitment underlies all collaborative activities.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><strong>Last Words </strong></h2>\r\n<p>To create, maintain, and share a strong relationship, stakeholders prefer networking for effective service delivery. Establishing the collaboration is to get succussed from resource sharing with rang of supportive operation under the governance approbations. From regular contribution to professional networking relationships, experts in relevant fields can be a sound stage for community services. So, over time, the benefits of collaboration and networking create new opportunities to build decisive, safe, healthy, and sustainable future goals with the members and other communities.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'how-to-network-and-collaborate-in-the-community-services-sector.jpg', 'how-to-network-and-collaborate-in-the-community-services-sector.jpeg', 'How to Network and Collaborate in The Community Services Sector?', 'How to Network and Collaborate in The Community Services Sector?', 1, '2021-08-30 22:36:22', '2021-09-04 20:31:26'),
(27, 1, 11, 'How to Start a Food Business From Home in Australia', 'how-to-start-a-food-business-from-home-in-australia', '<p>You love to cook for your family, and they also enjoy your food without any complaint. Now getting such compliments and praises, you might wonder how to start your own food business at home.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nowadays, many homemakers or ladies of the house are engaging in such food chain business starting from their place. Selling online homemade food is a common fact in Australia. But before starting a food business in Victoria or from Melbourne, you must need to<a href=\"https://itecounsel.com/blog/how-to-start-a-bakery-and-steps-to-open-a-bakery-business-in-australia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> know the requirements</a> to structure a food business from home.</p>\r\n<p>Starting a home-based food business as a beginner might look tough to grow. Still, some easy steps will help you figure out how to start a food business from home in Australia.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/Different Types of Food Businesses.jpg\" alt=\"Different Types of Food Businesses\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" /></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><strong>How to Start a Food Business From Home in Australia? (Basic Requirements)</strong></h2>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Having a Solid Business plan</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Before starting a business, there must need a proper plan according to the State/area, initial investment, business types, name, classification of food, and target customers. Without having such components in your plan list, you cannot identify the essential proportion of the food business. If you open a solo business at your home, then you must develop a written business plan according to your business type.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Choose a Brand Name and Logo</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>After finalizing the business plan, you have to find an engaging name for the organization\'s name and create a logo depending on the title. Those things will define your business theme, and to promote your online business presence, those are a must need. According to the business service drafts, hire a graphic designer to create a unique and dynamic name for the brand logo.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Ensure the Foods Quality</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Conclude whether your food product is safe for sale or not. Like you cannot serve your customer\'s low-grade food or unhygienic food service that will help you profit more. It will sink your business in the long run, or you may end up with a low reputation to run the business smoothly. For that, you will need to get a <a href=\"https://itecounsel.com/hospitality-industry/industry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">verified certificate</a> from the Local Quality Controller (QC).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/Making Quality Foods.jpg\" alt=\"Making Quality Food\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" /></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Verify the Kitchen Requirements</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Verify your kitchen elements and necessary food ingredients that meet the design requirements for the kitchen stuff. At least store enough units that will cover your daily need for a month of the business. Also, ensure your premise is well designed and fitted to handle the adequation of food safety and hygienic. Every cookery item and kitchen essentials should have the capacity to perform for your target people.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Be Sure with the State Policies</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Check your state or territory\'s rules that suit your type of homemade food business. There are different rules and regulations under each state classification, and food businesses must examine a Food Safety Supervisor by times. To maintain the territory\'s guidelines, you need to register your business name with the Australian Securities and Investments Commission (ASIC) and get an <a href=\"https://www.abr.gov.au/business-super-funds-charities/applying-abn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Australian Business Number (ABN)</a>.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Earn local Council or Business license</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Following the steps in mind, register your food business from the state\'s local Council and arrange to obtain an Australian business license. To get or learn more about the local Council\'s information related to the location and business type, you can simply visit the Australian Business Licence Center. Simply apply at your local Council for a business license and, with some easy inspection, get the food business license.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Apply for The Food Act Registration</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>A detailed kitchen layout and home business plan of all the finish schedules should detail the business nature. Everything should be included on the Food Act Registration application so that one of the Environmental Health Officers can visit your workstation and provide you with the essential advice regarding getting registered for the food act registration process. All the required documents may be applicable to submit under the conditions.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Required Training Course</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>You can\'t start your food business without having any of the professional certificates. Additionally, you will need to acquire some fundamental courses that will give you authentication certificates as a professional cook. For that, you can simply develop your food safety skills or can participate in some short courses to earn <a href=\"https://itecounsel.com/rpl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">RPL qualifications</a> <a href=\"https://itecounsel.com/SIT30816/course\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Certificate III in Commercial Cookery (SIT30816)</a> to start a home cookery business.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/Menu Selection Under Food Law.jpg\" alt=\"Menu Selection Under Food Law\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" /></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Menu Selection Under Food Law</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Consider what foods you want to serve the customers; moreover, where they will be sold, and the food menu should be selected. Under the Food Act Law 2003 and Food Regulation 2015, the food regulatory framework provides some guidelines that ensure the food is,</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Safe and suitable to consume by the customers.</li>\r\n<li>Ensuring the food quality that is not putting any unfair meaning.</li>\r\n<li>Check the menu list according to the preference and local guidance pricing.</li>\r\n<li>Don\'t label the package that is not consistent with the country\'s Food Standards Code.</li>\r\n<li>Give the full details of the food ingredients so that people get aware of what they are eating.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Food Delivery Services</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>As you are holding a home space for your food business, you don\'t have any sitting or dine arrangements inside your house. Then you must have to provide a food delivery services under the terms and conditions. Hire someone, or you can deliver your food all by yourself on the start-up position. Make sure to have a clean and hygienic container to provide your foodservice with quality taste on time.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><strong>Different Types of Food Businesses</strong></h2>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Different types of registration and license rules and regulations need to be adapted depending on the location of your food business. Here we list some of the typical food businesses that are prerequisites for a food business license;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Mobile Food Units</li>\r\n<li>Takeaway home food</li>\r\n<li>Community organizations</li>\r\n<li>Charities food facilities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Other types of home facility businesses include:</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Aged care food facilities</li>\r\n<li>Child care foodservice</li>\r\n<li>Corporate catering service</li>\r\n<li>Tour preparing snacks/meal</li>\r\n<li>Food processing companies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><strong>Conclusion </strong></h2>\r\n<p>Plan out your marketing strategy and get to know how you\'ll reach customers on social media or elsewhere online. Get advice from other entrepreneurs who have been through this process before determining your start-up costs and finance them on home food business. Here we get to know different types of meal businesses and how to start a food business from home in Australia? Including the classification of what are the Basic Requirements for Starting a food business in Australia.</p>', 'Starting a home-based food business as a beginner might look tough to grow. Still, some easy steps will help you figure out how to start a food business from home in Australia. ', 'How to Start a Food Business From Home in Australia', 'How to Start a Food Business From Home in Australia', 'how-to-start-a-food-business-from-home-in-australiajpeg.jpg', 'how-to-start-a-food-business-from-home-in-australiajpeg.jpg', 'How to Start a Food Business From Home in Australia', 'How to Start a Food Business From Home in Australia', 1, '2021-09-07 02:47:42', '2021-11-01 09:28:11');
INSERT INTO `blogs` (`id`, `action_user`, `blog_categories_id`, `blog_title`, `blog_slug`, `blog_des`, `meta_des`, `meta_tags`, `meta_keys`, `image`, `thumbnail`, `image_alt`, `thumbnail_alt`, `isPublished`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(28, 1, 11, 'What Are The Stages of Building Construction? - Complete Guide', 'what-are-the-stages-of-building-construction', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">If you are planning to construct a new home or renovate the old house into modern facilities, then going through a proper plan is needed. There are some certain stages to construction building in an appropriate manner. According to the construction law in Australia, some essential components should be adjusted and required to maintain during your construction period.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">Providing quality house materials and outstanding interior design won&rsquo;t be enough to make your house durable. To make a desirable and budget-friendly house construction, you must know the working process and have to adopt some basic procedures to create an outstanding outcome depending on the location. So, here you will learn the stages of building construction for small and big premises and how to complete those stages based on the real-life phases.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 24.0pt; line-height: 107%; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">What Are The Stages of Building Construction? </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<h3 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">A Proper Planning</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">The initial stage of performing a construction site is to make a good construction architecture and budgeting plan. Then, the first stage of construction is to plan the house structure and let the contractors inspect the area where the premise will stand.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">After the proper inspections, hire an expert contractor for a small house or an architect for an on-site prefabrication building.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"../../../public/blogImages/A Proper Planning Before Building &amp; Construction.jpg\" alt=\"A Proper Planning Before Building &amp; Construction\" width=\"516\" height=\"344\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">After collecting the estimated budgets from the project holder, decide the budgeting amount according to the best-offered price. Now make a timeline for each individual task and follow up the planned schedule according to the drafts of your building. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<h3 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">Excavation and Foundation</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">One of the essential parts of the construction is the excavation of building foundations. Digging out a foundation for your building depends on the construction site&rsquo;s soil and the surface of the underground platforms. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">If you plan to build a high raised building on a dump area, it won&rsquo;t be a good choice for your execution part as those high constructions need strong base support and proper excavation of the flat surface. But remember, external support is vital than the outsider structure. Solid grounding, pillars footing and usage of PPC cement is must in any foundation process. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<h3 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">Mechanical, Electrical, and Plumbing Lines</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">Considering the work line, always keep in mind the machinery used for the construction site as you can&rsquo;t always drag things from here to there. Depending on your need, use those things and include the work schedule into the construction plan.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"../../../public/blogImages/Plumbing Lines of  Constructoin Building.jpg\" alt=\"Plumbing Lines of Building Construction\" width=\"507\" height=\"338\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">Now before you add the bricks, make plans to adjust the electrical and plumbing lines. Just because you can&rsquo;t keep changing those essential utility lines every day, so, considering those matters, you should have a proper finishing of the floors and room structure especially, the bathrooms and kitchen for plumbing. In addition, maintenance roof drains, HVAC systems, ventilation, lighting, water and waste pipes, gas lines, and internet cables are vital issues. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<h3 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">Framing and Roofing</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">If you are done with the electrical and plumbing lines, then you must pay attention to the wall framing and house roofing. Depending on the base construction, surround the wall frame with bricks, or build the walls with different materials. After completing the ground and framing the wall, let a concern install a roof of your house. There must be the best layout on each floor for brick constructions, and for wooden or semi brick houses, there needs to be one strong roof according to your budget and roofing materials. After done with those, don&rsquo;t forget to add building insulation on the house floors. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<h3 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">Exterior Finish</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">Apply the render or stucco to the outside of the house to protect the building and everything inside from external forces of dust, lights, and rain, and not get leaked from outside. Likewise, exterior finishes protect the outside covering of a building against the outside weather elements.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">To have a more protection layer, you can add a weather Cotting element to Decore the house walls and make the finishing lines with the smooth and shining textures from the outside. Use quality materials and a modern locking system on the doors and windows for getting security. For customize and modern style space, you can build a lawn or yard Infront of your house. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<h3 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">Interior Finish</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">Now let&rsquo;s work on the interior designs and painting work inside your house. Immediately after your work with the outside renovation, you must work on the floor installations and add the necessary electrical fixtures and plumbing parts. Those tasks should be done before you start to paint or use papers on your walls and ceilings.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"../../../public/blogImages/Interior Finish.jpg\" alt=\"Interior Finish\" width=\"520\" height=\"390\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">Even counting the windows and doors installation inside the house should be set according to your need. Fix the wall dents or ceiling gaps if there are any of those. But always remember to add the final flourishes during this stage, including glassware, finished carpentry, tiling, carpeting, and more. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<h3 class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">Final Inspection</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">Before you can move into your new house, you have to final inspect overall fittings and installations. So don&rsquo;t just rush to shift into your new construction; do the full check-up and look over all the planned components along with the used materials and leftover inventories. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">Once everything is complete and final inspections are made, go on the ending walkthrough as the building owner or the project manager. Fabricate the checklist for each task and perform it to ensure everything is completed according to the plan and the structure is ready for occupancy. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<h2><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 24.0pt; line-height: 107%; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">Conclusion</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">Suppose you are going to build a house for you and your family members to live happily, so thinking of that, you are required that the place should be more protective and durable with all the furnishing facilities. Now, you cannot trust anyone blindly and need to make the proper arrangement for the off-site area at the beginning. Also, your responsibility is to provide the house safety and get along with house construction from start to finish. In the upper discussion, you will get to know all the essential stages of your house renovations and the fundamental part to maintain construction sites as a house owner.</span></p>', 'In the upper discussion, you will get to know all the essential stages of your house renovations and the fundamental part to maintain construction sites as a house owner.', 'What Are The Stages of Building Construction', 'What Are The Stages of Building Construction', 'stages-of-building-construction.jpg', 'what-are-the-stages-of-building-construction.jpeg', 'Stages of Building Construction', 'What Are The Stages of Building Construction', 1, '2021-09-14 22:02:43', '2021-09-15 20:45:00'),
(29, 1, 4, 'What is RPL & How does RPL Work in Australia?', 'what-is-rpl-how-does-rpl-work-in-australia', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">Thinking of your income and expenses in Australia, it may not be significant in ratio. However, the overall living and spending cost may exceed your regular earning, which may be more frustrating for you. Even the job positions are not really meet your expectation because of good qualifications and degrees. Though you have skills and demanding working experience, which is quite impressive, you are still not making any progress for the future because of the proper enhancement of your prior knowledge.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">Now, if you believe that you are worth getting an excellent career in Australia, you are lacking in holding your phase because of an approval certificate. One of the most reliable ways is to earn RPL accredited qualifications in your preferable industry. You need to understand how RPL works and </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\"><a href=\"https://itecounsel.com/blog/how-an-rpl-assessment-works-that-can-build-a-bright-future-in-australia\"><span style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\">how an RPL assessment helps build a bright future</span></a></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\"> in Australia? Let&rsquo;s discuss the pathways of RPL assessment in some easy steps. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 24.0pt; line-height: 107%; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">What is RPL?<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">The Recognition of Prior Learning (RPL) is an assessment training program that is set based on skills, knowledge, and previous working experiences. RPL is a combined package for an experienced worker to earn a professional qualification. It gives the possible chances to have a great deal in the Australian job market. Usually, minimum criteria need to follow to earn an RPL certificate. Perhaps anyone with legit working experience or proficiency in real life can apply for the RPL assessment if the person is eligible with all the proven documents. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 24.0pt; line-height: 107%; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">Who can Get RPL?</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">Suppose you are skilled enough in a particular industry and have worked for a long time in a specific area. Then you might have the high possibility to earn an RPL license in Australia. Basically, those who are well trained and have years of experience in undergo industry may allow applying for the recognition of prior learning in the relevant interests. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">As a part of the professional qualification, a candidate may need to provide all the essential documents for cross-checking of individual&rsquo;s identity and previous working lines. Depending on the RTO&rsquo;s, some changes may be acceptable under the Australian Qualification of Framework (AQF). Especially, the chosen course requirements may need to count to get candidates. So, for the inexperienced people, there are other RPL qualifications available, and the people who have multiple years of experience but no undergrad degree are also suitable as an applicant. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 24.0pt; line-height: 107%; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">How does It Work in Australia?<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">The accredited RPL qualification is one of the popular career build-up sources for most Australians. Sometimes capabilities are not overwhelming as real-world experience. With the help of RPL objects, anyone can set a career goal by using prior expertise and acquaintance with vast working knowledge.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">Many industries are now asking for RPL certified employees as it is easier for them to hire a qualified person with just a glance at the certificate. Even the salary for that certified RPL holder is much better than regular work as the assessment processes approves their skilled test. </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">An RPL certificate plays a forwarding role in demonstrating your job for an easy promotion or being employed in managerial positions. As your prior experience and skills are considered to meet the standards of industries through the RPL certificates. </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">Even with just a minimum of knowledge, you can apply for Diploma courses and initial courses. Not just that, after completion of duration you will be eligible for the advance certificates which is really a significant advantage to promote and develop your skills. So rather than learning from scratch, focus on a particular interest where you are good at that can become from the formal training and education. </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">To apply for an RPL, you will need to draft the recent evidence of your skills and knowledge. After then provide the contact details of people who can confirm your abilities as the reference. These people might be supervisors or other superior ones in your community who observe your skills in action. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 24.0pt; line-height: 107%; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">How to Apply for RPL: The application process for RPL</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">Through an RTO agency, you are allowed to apply for an RPL. Just follow the four easy steps to get qualified for the RPL license in Australia. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">FREE SKILLS ASSESSMENT </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">A free, no-obligation, RPL skills check provided by an experienced RTO representative. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">EVIDENCE PORTFOLIO </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">Compiling and submitting your &lsquo;Experience Portfolio&rsquo; provides relevant documentation such as photos and videos of you on the job, references, previous qualifications, current resume, etc. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">3.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">SKILLS CHECK </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">A qualified assessor from one of our partnering RTOs, will review the evidence and determine if you are competent in the units for that qualification via an RPL assessment. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">4.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">QUALIFIED! </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">If the RTO assesses you as competent in all required units of competency, then a qualification will be awarded by the registered training organization. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 24.0pt; line-height: 107%; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">What are The Benefits of Getting Your Qualification Through RPL?</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">You will always find out some tricky benefits and long-term working facilities of an RPL assessment program. However, with all the purposes of the skill assessment, nothing is up to the loss. Eventually, you will get more and more confident to apply those terms in the job sector. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">RPL for Australian immigration </span></p>\r\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">Job Security </span></p>\r\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">Well-paid Jobs </span></p>\r\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">Early Promotions </span></p>\r\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">Entrepreneurship </span></p>\r\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">Various Opportunities </span></p>\r\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">Cost-efficient </span></p>\r\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">Time Sustainable </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 24.0pt; line-height: 107%; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">What are The Requirements Needed to Pass The RPL Assessment Tests?<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">Before applying for an RPL certification test, you must know the vital requirements for getting an RPL qualification. Several zones are available to submit an RPL application. Now make a choice, where can you put yourself in this skills assessment test? In general, the RPL assessments may require the same components, but sometimes it may differ from course to course. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">Make sure to provide the required and relevant paper files that are mentioned in the individual form.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">Specified working experience, and proven documents (Based on which sector you want to earn the RPL)<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> &nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">Now compiling to submit your best portfolio such as previous qualifications, any bachelor or relevant degree (If any), job references, work-line photos, and videos, and most importantly, your updated resume.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">The recommendation letter of an authorized agent and all the government-certified attached files.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">All those requirements are important to pass the assessment tests, but other documents can be required if necessary. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a;\">In every state in Australia, the demand for this qualification is rising tremendously. So, get your recognition of a prior learning certificate to make a smooth career bridge in Australia by following the steps of the RPL application process.</span></p>', 'You need to understand how does RPL works and how an RPL assessment helps build a bright future in Australia?', 'How does RPL Work in Australia', 'How does RPL Work in Australia', 'what-is-rpl.jpg', 'how-does-rpl-work-in-australia.jpeg', 'What is RPL', 'How does RPL Work in Australia', 1, '2021-09-22 20:49:14', '2021-09-22 20:50:32');
INSERT INTO `blogs` (`id`, `action_user`, `blog_categories_id`, `blog_title`, `blog_slug`, `blog_des`, `meta_des`, `meta_tags`, `meta_keys`, `image`, `thumbnail`, `image_alt`, `thumbnail_alt`, `isPublished`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(30, 1, 11, 'How are Human Rights Applied in The Community Services Sector?', 'how-are-human-rights-applied-in-the-community-services-sector', '<p>From the revolutionary change of human existence, people are found to fight for their socio rights now and then. Democratic country\'s people have stated the human rights parliament seeks explicitly to protect and promote community sectors for the need of certain groups.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Apparently, human rights are essential in a democratic and inclusive society that respects the rule of law. Abid the community rules and regulations, each living being has the right to sentence for government protections and living rights with the nation\'s facilities. Along with this concept, to serve community services, human rights are applicable and should have sustainable law maintenance under the state references. Confirming Source of Victorian Charter of Human Rights and Responsibilities Act 2006 (VIC) that community services have some code to follow for ideal human rights.</p>\r\n<p>So, let\'s get straight to know how are human rights applied in the community service sector and what are the legal human rights? Also, adding the part of What is the importance of human rights to development in community services?&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><strong>What are Human Rights?</strong></h2>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>According to Queensland\'s Human Rights Act, there are vital 23 human protective rights in Australia. The Human Rights Act 2019 set down the principle segmented in the International Covenant on Civil and Political Rights. Also, to provide an explicit statutory basis for respecting, protecting, and promoting civil and political rights. Combining the rights protections include:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The right to live holding citizenship;</li>\r\n<li>Protection from torture and inhuman act or degrading treatment;</li>\r\n<li>Get the family and children protected by all mean;</li>\r\n<li>Freedom to perform the religious culture which is suitable under the law.</li>\r\n<li>Get the right on religious acts thought, conscience, and faith;</li>\r\n<li>The advantage to peaceful association and freedom of relationship;</li>\r\n<li>Freedom of eloquence and protest for any unfair meanings.</li>\r\n<li>Human rights include the right to secure life and liberty without any slavery consequences.</li>\r\n<li>For social development requires a greater understanding of social systems and the political dimensions.</li>\r\n<li>Have human treatment when deprived of liberty\'s opinion and expressions.</li>\r\n<li>The fundamental rights of minorities in case of parenting.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>In addition, everyone has the right to enjoy their human rights without distinction or discrimination of any kind under Section 8(2) of the Act.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><strong>How do They Apply in The Community Services Sector?</strong></h2>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Community services ensure people\'s basic needs are met. Whenever you are up to help people in a community sector, you must be aware of your acts before implementing them. There is a significant role in serving people\'s basic needs via the community services act to meet their essential needs in the human rights deal.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Protect Vulnerable Groups from Abuse</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To work as a community worker, you can use your human rights to protest for any authorized country issues and protect from any abuse acts by the local authority. In addition, the community service holders are free to ask for their country\'s rights against any injustice or violent actions, including those who are disabled and LGBT too.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Social Awareness Allow to Stand Up Against Societal Corruption&nbsp;</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Let\'s say having the stand-up social activities on corruption and socialism is a human right. From the concept of human empower rights, people deserve to live with the dignity that affects the government and working environment. Where they can stand to stop the social corruption through community services.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Community Service\'s Give Freedom of Speech and Expression</strong></h3>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp; </strong></p>\r\n<p>In the name of speaking the right without fear of brutal reprisal can cost a lot. Social community workers can structure against the encompasses ideas and form to express their freedom of speech. So, they can debate and argue for any unfairness providing specific ideas for the welfare of the society.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Encourage Equal Work Opportunities</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In society, living peacefully and getting a job permit to flourish in any work environment can be biased or goes downright observation as a fundamental human right. Usually, people find difficulty among themselves by enduring or abusing career opportunities. When every living human has the right to get treated and encourages to earn equality, in this purpose, community organizations also adopt to help those help and encourage to get the equal right of working opportunities.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Give People Access to Education</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To get similar educational activities are human rights. However, due to the absence of proper education and knowledge, people have the authorization to get paid for their work and the government\'s tuition fees. Therefore, community organizations are motivated to provide support on essential education and job to reduce the cycle of poverty.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Public Authorities Include:&nbsp;</strong></h3>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Social services.</li>\r\n<li>Private care homes funded.</li>\r\n<li>Local authority and NHS-funded care homes.</li>\r\n<li>NHS health services like hospitals, GPs, and dentists other NHS bodies like NHS trusts in Australia, Local Health Boards.</li>\r\n<li>Private healthcare organizations providing NHS services the Care Quality Commission and</li>\r\n<li>Social Services Inspectorate in Wales and the Care Inspectorate in Scotland.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><strong>Who must Respect Your Human Rights?&nbsp; </strong></h2>\r\n<p>The highest public authorities are responsible for providing human rights against health care and proper living hood. But in most of the case, the social organizations are worked for human rights and do all other durable activities that will change the perspective of the society\'s out view. Moreover, human rights have been conducted from the counter number of social developments. Most of the time, positive steps aren\'t breached upon human rights. So, community holders or workers help apply human rights law for the nation\'s court of action.&nbsp;</p>', 'let\'s get straight to know how are human rights applied in the community service sector and what are the legal human rights?', 'How are Human Rights Applied in The Community Services Sector', 'How are Human Rights Applied in The Community Services Sector', 'human-rights-applied-in-the-community-services-sector.jpg', 'how-are-human-rights-applied-in-the-community-services-sector.jpeg', 'Human Rights Applied in The Community Services Sector', 'How are Human Rights Applied in The Community Services Sector', 1, '2021-09-28 04:32:33', '2021-09-28 04:32:33'),
(31, 1, 4, 'Why Study Commercial Cookery in Australia?', 'why-study-commercial-cookery-in-australia', '<p>Once, the career in cook was a low-paid job unless you were well skilled or certified. Those days are gone, and considering the job contrast, this industry got a huge charm and is one of the paid jobs in Australia. To become a regular chef in a well-known restaurant or starred hotel, you may require to have enough cooking skills. Along with proper cooking skills and efficiencies, you must need broader knowledge about a healthy perspective on food ingredients.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/commercial cooking.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"426\" /></p>\r\n<p>A <a href=\"https://itecounsel.com/blog/how-to-make-money-by-showing-your-love-for-cooking\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">career in commercial cooking</a> can be very exciting, and it offers plenty of different avenues and opportunities to explore your profession. If you are very passionate about your cooking interest, you will find many grounds to grow your future in Australia. Now it is important to understand what are you aim to do with your cooking expertise. Having a professional degree or certificate in commercial cookery will help you to meet your desired opportunities. Even conducting a commercial cookery qualification can lead you to open a whole new slot to become an owner of a restaurant. Merging all those things in one place, you may wonder to know why you study commercial cookery in Australia? And what are the <a href=\"https://itecounsel.com/blog/why-study-commercial-cookery-in-australia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">benefits to get the qualification</a> to excel in your career in the cooking industry? So, carrying the topic, let&rsquo;s head for the more in-depth result to understand your queries about studying commercial cookery.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Reasons to Study: Why Study Commercial Cookery in Australia? </strong></p>\r\n<p>If you already got into this paragraph, you have interests in cooking or related job experience. Now assume you decide to pull your career in the cookery business and want to live the life under your choice in the cookery industry. So, before you start to enroll in your learning choice, you need to figure out where and how to continue with this. In Australia, there are plenty of major consequences to maintain according to the states and academic acceptances. One of the simplest ways is to obtain a certificate or diploma in commercial cookery in Australia for getting such short mind-blowing scopes. Here we are interpreting some of the basic benefits of studying commercial cookery.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Bustling Hospitality Eligibility </strong></p>\r\n<p>To immerse yourself in your cooking career, you have to earn the best preferences of your interest in cooking. Getting a strong job perspective under terms and conditions is one of the best parts of studying commercial cookery. Getting a diploma or acceptability from state authority will help to bustle your hospitality skills too. By immersing yourself in a strong food sense and surrounding yourself with people who have the same attraction for food will help you to learn new food experiences. Along with that, you can get the chance to research the food ingredients.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Easy Training Process </strong></p>\r\n<p>If you have chosen to study in commercial cookery courses, you must be aware of the eligibility processes. You can do many courses online but getting the practical training to grow yourself into a professional chef. Even if you have little working experience, you can apply for an RPL qualification of <a href=\"https://itecounsel.com/SIT30816/course\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Certificate III in Commercial Cookery (SIT30816) </a>and <a href=\"https://itecounsel.com/SIT40516/course\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Certificate IV in Commercial Cookery (SIT40516)</a>. Those certificates are authorized qualification programs for experience people.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Well-Paid Job </strong><a href=\"https://www.payscale.com/research/AU/Job=Cook%2C_Restaurant/Salary\">Source</a></p>\r\n<p>An entry-level Cook, Restaurant with less than 1 year of experience can expect to earn an average total compensation of AU$21.26 based on 33 salaries. An early career Cook, a Restaurant with 1-4 years of experience earns an average total compensation of AU$22.13 based on 493 salaries. A mid-career Cook, an Eatery with 5-9 years of experience, earns an average total compensation of AU$23.94 based on 216 salaries. An experienced Cook, Restaurant with 10-19 years of experience earns an average total compensation of AU$22.90 based on 96 salaries. In their late-career (20 years and higher), employees earn an average total compensation of AU$24.</p>\r\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/job.jfif\" alt=\"\" width=\"646\" height=\"341\" /></p>\r\n<p><strong>Figure: The basic graphical view of a chef&rsquo;s payoff hourly based (includes tips, bonus, and overtime pay) </strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Career Paths </strong></p>\r\n<p>You can broader your job diagnosing by starting with the proper qualification in studying commercial cookery. Plenty of options are opened for you to bloom your career in the cooking industry. Now understanding your need, you have to dash for your best absorptions. Suppose you want to recall those job lines once you are done with your professional degree. You can apply to become a fresh chef to kitchen chef. Containing your experience and license, you can develop your work promotion to head chef and other major positions in the kitchen. Even you have a chance to apply for the executive chef when you are ready to go with your dynamic skills.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Great Way to Live in OZ</strong></p>\r\n<p>Having a secure job will give you a better vibe to live a good life in Australia. As this profession has many possible opportunities to grow your career, so you can have a golden chance to meet your needs and adequate to make a sustainable future in many states of Australia. Moreover, the salary is well-enough to live in a great way. Assume that you are qualified for applying in the cooking profession and got a job in a restaurant as a chef because of your preferred degree. So, having studied in commercial cookery will help you to sharp your living style.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Become an Owner of Your Dream</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/RPL in commercial cooking.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"426\" /></strong></p>\r\n<p>Even with such proficiency, you can fulfill your dream to open a food restaurant in Australia. However, you can&rsquo;t build your food empire by just wishing it. For that, you should have such accredited capability and suitableness knowledge in the food industry. For that, you can focus on the commercial cookery academic courses. By completing cookery eligibility, you can apply for the cookery business license, and later, you can start your dream food business in Australia.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Context </strong></p>\r\n<p>Choosing a <a href=\"https://itecounsel.com/blog/a-complete-guide-to-commercial-cookery-course-steps-to-complete-rpl-qualifications\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">commercial cookery course</a> will help you receive a quality education and let you understand your inner skills preferences that you&rsquo;re looking to grow your future career. Nowadays, males are more injecting into this profession rather than women. About 62% of males and the rest of the portion is female who is engaging in this cooking profession and also getting the subsidiaries facilities as a chef. So, there are many other benefits and opportunities with people who love food just as much as you do by establishing networks while studying commercial cookery in Australia.</p>', 'A career in commercial cooking can be very exciting, and it offers plenty of different avenues and opportunities to explore your profession.', 'Why Study Commercial Cookery in Australia?', 'Why Study Commercial Cookery in Australia, Commercial Cookery in Australia, Study Commercial Cookery', 'why-study-commercial-cookery-in-australia.jpg', 'why-study-commercial-cookery-in-australia.jpeg', 'Why Study Commercial Cookery in Australia?', 'Why Study Commercial Cookery in Australia?', 1, '2021-10-10 21:19:33', '2021-11-05 12:42:39'),
(32, 1, 6, 'How is Australia Supporting The Safe Return of International Students After Covid Break?', 'how-is-australia-supporting-the-safe-return-of-international-students-after-covid-break', '<p>Immediately after the outbreak of the Covid situation, an emotional challenge arises for many international students to go back to their academic curriculum. The coronavirus caused many damages to the dear one and you or your family too. Many students got stuck in this international outline and border issues to travel on their destination during the covid pandemic. As a result, people are breaking down from the inside because of distress or anxiety.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The Australian Government\'s Departure of Education and Training states that Australia has more international students than other nearby countries. Over 900,000 international students have been enrolled in educational programs in Australia so far. But the number was dropping because of the international covid situation, and it reached to a serious affair for those non-resident students in Australia. Still, there is good news for those students as the Australian borders will retrieve open, and people are getting back to their regular life. Even the time is still challenging onwards for everyone, so the Australian Government is working on that to help the international students to come back after the covid break. Maintaining the safe return of international students in Australia, the country\'s Government has taken some serious steps to stop spreading the virus. Also, taking the initiative to provide tangible support in terms of food, finances, or accommodation and accessible educational facilities for scholar students.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/WhatsApp Image 2021-10-14 at 6.25.24 PM (1).jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"710\" height=\"446\" /></p>\r\n<p>The presence of Covid-19 will remain long, as per the World Health Organization (WHO) detailed. So, ensuring a safe return and vaccination is really important for international students. Considering the combined changes in education and employment structures, Australia supports the safe return of international students after the Covid break. So, let\'s discuss this more in detail.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>What Are the Supports Providing for the International Students After Covid Break in Australia? </strong></p>\r\n<p>Australia Government is constantly updating the health and safety measures and travel restrictions to prevent the spread of the Covid-19. Along with that, some essential parts are covering to give the best support for the international followers. So, learn further to know about the Australian perspective of the safety guidelines for overseas students.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Ensuring The Health Issues </strong></p>\r\n<p>Australian authority is highly concerned about the health issues of current and upcoming days. Students are instructed to keep a distance and maintain a safe distance from the social gathering. Also, for the international flight tour, they are recommended to fly when they are stable without major or minor health issues. Total consideration is applicable to ensure better and acceptable physical conditions for the students.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Home Quarantine Facilities </strong></p>\r\n<p>When you get a long flight from your place to Australia, you must lock yourself for 14 days of home quarantine. As a rule of the Australian Government, you must obey this safety module for yourself and the citizens of your area. Now you must wonder how you will survive on those days without stepping outside for your daily necessities. But don\'t get worried, higher authority from your area will provide you with all those vital things like foods, medicine and other important household items if necessary.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Travelling Safety&nbsp; </strong></p>\r\n<p>As all the international flights are getting opened and people are moving from one distance to another frequently. So, the Australian Government is increasing the overall safety patterns for those international and domestic flights. The airports and other transportation services are improving with safety facilities. Still, there are some barriers in international flight, while people have to maintain those safety rules to travel. Even the number of states flight are decreasing with better health precautions.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Certified Vaccination&nbsp; </strong></p>\r\n<p>One of the safety measures is taken by the Australian Government to provide an international approved vaccine of Covid virus to the existing citizens. Focusing on minimizing the risks of Covid, International students will get the best experience from the Australian government services than the other countries around the world. Also, no one can enter from the international border without being vaccinated, giving a confident protection shield from getting infected by the Covid virus.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Scholarship Opportunities </strong></p>\r\n<p>After the breakdown of Covid, many students are now showing more interested in abroad study in Australia more than in any other country as the education system is relatively standard and reliable, so everyone prefers Australia as their first choice. Moreover, many Australian universities are also giving opportunities for international students to engage and lead them with scholarships. The Government is also giving permits to the visa for newcomers after Covid-19.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Safe Education Policy </strong></p>\r\n<p>The Government is taking the strict policy to provide safe education while students are getting back to their academic premises. For making smooth operation, the Australian education Ministry alert every institution to follow the safety guidelines. Making all the possible terms to ensure the most promising academic activities. To prevent risk factors in severe disease and intensive care, the process of admission is taken place under pre-existing medical conditions inside the academy.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Mental Support and Counselling </strong></p>\r\n<p>Nowadays, many students prefer to step outside or not get motivated to continue their studies in this pandemic situation. Especially international students are also going back to their home country when the situation is serious. Now, after the Covid breakdown, everything is back to normal form while many authorities are giving mental support and free counselling to avoid getting distracted from the current situation or the upcoming days.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Extend the Visa Migration </strong></p>\r\n<p>To support and build good connections, the higher mastery allows the students to come back to Australia. Even the validities of the visa have been extended based on the schedule support. The outer students from Australia are being motivated due to such facilities from the government decisions. Anyone with an Australian visa can apply to extend their visa migration to continue their degree program after this Covid term.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Summing-up </strong></p>\r\n<p>Not all those, even there are accessible states transits and living subsidiaries benefits for those oversea students. Now the current situation can\'t be omitted over the days or months. But the Australian authority is doing great to welcome the extended or new foreign students after the covid breakdown. However, it is still understructure. So, the OZ government focuses on international students to provide outstanding support to head back to Australia.</p>', 'The Australian Government\'s Departure of Education and Training states that Australia has more international students than other nearby countries.', 'International Students After Covid Break, Return of International Students, Students After Covid Break', 'Return of International Students After Covid Break', 'how-is-australia-supporting-the-safe-return-of-international-students-after-covid-break.jpg', 'how-is-australia-supporting-the-safe-return-of-international-students-after-covid-break.jpeg', 'How is Australia Supporting The Safe Return of International Students After Covid Break?', 'How is Australia Supporting The Safe Return of International Students After Covid Break?', 1, '2021-10-16 23:36:48', '2021-10-16 23:39:14'),
(34, 1, 4, 'A Complete Guide to Commercial Cookery Course: Steps to Complete RPL Qualifications', 'a-complete-guide-to-commercial-cookery-course-steps-to-complete-rpl-qualifications', '<p>Enhance your cooking passion into a profession and get more career paths by enrolling yourself for a higher-paying job in Australia. Commercial Cookery course prepares you for a role as a Professional Chef in Australia. There, you will learn the latest cooking technologies and culinary techniques and learn specialty menu planning and financial management. Nowadays, Australian and other international residents are very much likely to show interest in cookery jobs and food industries.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>For them, one of the outstanding opportunities is to get a standard professional source by earning <a href=\"../../rpl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Recognised Prior Learning (RPL)</a>, <a href=\"../../SIT30816/course\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Certificate III in Commercial Cookery (SIT30816)</a>. This commercial course will assist in gaining the knowledge and skills to work effectively under an industrial cookery team. Along with that, you will learn <a href=\"../../FBP30317/course\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">how to bake tasty cakes and pastries</a>, cookies, tarts, flavored pastries, and various chocolates. Count the job roles; this qualification provides a pathway to work as a commercial cook in organizations such as restaurants, hotels, clubs, pubs, cafes, cafeterias, and coffee shops. As we mentioned earlier, there are a lot of scopes to bloom yourself in the cooking industry. So, let\'s talk about the pathway of a complete guide to a commercial cookery course and the steps to earn RPL Qualifications in Cookery.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Benefits of Study Commercial Cookery Course </strong></p>\r\n<p>This Commercial cookery course qualification reflects the role of industrial cooks who use a wide range of cookery skills. They use circumspection and judgment to have a sound knowledge of kitchen services. They run services independently under limited supervision where they may assign to provide relevant advice and support the team members.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>It\'s a Growing-Industry Job </strong></p>\r\n<p>There is a high demand for professional cooks who can manage kitchen tools, train staff, develop different recipes or dishes, and ensure high quality of food hygienic and health following proper rules and regulations. No matter what, you are always to any restaurant until you hold qualified certificate because people are showing their willingness to get into this commercial food industry.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Global Career Opportunities </strong></p>\r\n<p>Not only in Australia, with this certificate and qualification skills, but you can also blend to get a preferable job overseas or nearby states in Australia. Choosing a career in this industry is a great choice to explore the Australian job market as much as possible. It doesn\'t matter where you are from, as there is a high possibility to get excellent earning sources to form this qualification and skills.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Share Your Love for Food </strong></p>\r\n<p>One of the biggest reasons to study commercial cookery courses is to explore yourself, show affection for your cooking skills, and expand food knowledge. By considering this fact, commercial cooking is the best choice to find passions about food, and this would be a highly rewarding career in Australia. So, make your soft-corner for the cooking industry and share your love for nutrition.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Become a Recognised Chef in Your Town </strong></p>\r\n<p>This commercial course is precious and more convenient in professional job sectors. Where you can identify as a full-time cook and apply to become a recognized chef in your area, only some of the Australian RTO\'s are offering these commercial cookery courses on demand of the candidates. If you have any previous working experience or cooking, you can apply directly for the RPL services under some conditions.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>A Complete Guide to Commercial Cookery Course: Requirements and Qualifications&nbsp; </strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Licensing/Regulatory Information&nbsp; </strong></p>\r\n<p>No licensing, legislative, regulatory, or certification requirements apply to this qualification at the time of endorsement.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Entry Requirements&nbsp; </strong></p>\r\n<p>No particular conditions are required for this qualification. But some minimum requirement needs to follow up for studying Commercial Cookery which are,&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>An overall point of 5.5 in IELTS with no band less than score five.</li>\r\n<li>A minimum degree of high school or equivalent learning completion.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Pathways Into the Eligibility </strong></p>\r\n<p>Individuals may enter SIT30812 Certificate III in Commercial Cookery with limited or no vocational experience and without a lower-level of cooking qualification. But it is always good to have some in your account for more developments.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Pathways From the Qualification&nbsp;&nbsp; </strong></p>\r\n<p>Certificate III in Commercial Cookery (SIT30812) is a one-year training course that offers practical and theoretical subjective training regarding cook and kitchen knowledge. It is mandatory to have workplace training constantly for ten weeks under hospitality facilities as a trainee chef in restaurants, hotels, cafes, coffee shops, etc.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>After achieving Certificate III in Commercial Cookery individuals, you could progress to Certificate IV in Commercial Cookery (SIT40412), Certificate IV in Catering Operations (SIT40612), or Certificate IV in Patisserie (SIT40712) for more skills improvements.</p>\r\n<p>Certificate III in Commercial Cookery will make you eligible to become a qualified cook around Australia, where you can put a little bit more effort to complete other relevant RPL Qualifications to promote you as a competent chef.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Employability Skills Summary </strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Communication</li>\r\n<li>Initiative and enterprise</li>\r\n<li>Learning</li>\r\n<li>Planning and organizing</li>\r\n<li>Problem-solving</li>\r\n<li>Self-management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Course Packaging Rules&nbsp; </strong></p>\r\n<p>The Commercial Cookery Certificates III holds a total of 25 units to be completed where the total number of 22 is core units, and the rests are elective units, consisting of:</p>\r\n<p>The three units from the package list, elsewhere in SIT12 Training Package, or any other current Training Package or accredited courses.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>(Note: The outcome must conduct the elective subjects to be solicited, local industry requirements, and the complexity of abilities fit according to the AQF level for this qualification)&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Conclusion&nbsp; </strong></p>\r\n<p>It takes four weeks of receiving sufficient and complying evidence of competency in all applied units to become certified participants. Now, Certificate III in Commercial Cookery will lay out with the experience of cleaning and sanitization. Also, get to learn more about food safety programs, personal hygiene, and workplace health and safety issues. In this industry, professional trainers will teach you how to run a kitchen and manage a business so that you can prepare for wherever you want to give blossom into your cooking profession.</p>', NULL, NULL, 'Guide to Commercial Cookery Course, RPL, RPL in Cookery', 'a-complete-guide-to-commercial-cookery-course-steps-to-complete-rpl-qualificationsjpegjpeg.jpg', 'a-complete-guide-to-commercial-cookery-course-steps-to-complete-rpl-qualificationsjpeg.jpeg', NULL, 'Guide to Commercial Cookery Course', 1, '2021-10-31 05:18:23', '2021-11-03 20:52:47'),
(35, 1, 4, 'How to Make Money by Showing Your Love for Cooking?', 'how-to-make-money-by-showing-your-love-for-cooking', '<p>Let\'s say you are pretty good at house cooking and sometimes like to do experiments with your cooking knowledge. Now you only have your family who loves to eat your food and never miss to appreciate your outstanding cooking skills. Wondering if you can make money from this cooking passion, then what will you do? Nowadays, the ladies of the house are becoming more passionate about earning money from their house. Like other passionate things, cooking is one of the most demandable and fun-loving jobs for most people. Even there are various <a href=\"https://itecounsel.com/blog/how-to-start-a-food-business-from-home-in-australia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">opportunities to make money</a> with what they always love to do as a cook.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Many food industries are now growing from the house spots. Following that, many people provide various food services from their place and make money on a high margin. Still, if you are expecting to put some incredible changes in your career with your food love, it will be best to start from now by understanding your expertise level in cooking. Or here we make it easier for you and recommend how to make money doing what you love in cooking? So, comfort yourself and explore all the golden opportunities to shape your cooking skills into career development.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><strong>Making Money Doing What You Love: Opportunities in Cooking Sectors</strong></h2>\r\n<p><strong>Start Cooking Classes</strong></p>\r\n<p>It is not a bad idea to give or teach candidates some of the basic cooking skills. You can open a cooking school at your home or any rented kitchen. Teach your student based on fees under a scheduled period or course sessions. That is the easiest way to earn money with your gigantic cooking knowledge to balance a healthy work-life.</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Online Cook Classes</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Don\'t lose your hope if you have low opportunities to make your cookery business into something big because of place and investment. You can start your cooking channel in online media to promote yourself. Also, you can upload your daily cooking activities to attract viewers with unique cooking recipes, and later you can start online classes if anyone gets interested.</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Cooking Recipe Writer</strong></h3>\r\n<p>You have plenty of options to expand your ideas and skills with masterpiece cooking recipes. Along with videos and online tuition, you can sell your recipe to the most renowned restaurants to earn an exclusive amount of money. Do your experiment and learn more from your outcomes, and later, you can cover any album about your amazing cooking recipe as a recipe writer.</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Become a Restaurant Chef</strong></h3>\r\n<p>With your proper qualification and learning knowledge of cooking, you can apply for <a href=\"https://itecounsel.com/SIT30816/course\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Recognition of Prior Learning (RPL) Certificate III </a>&amp; <a href=\"https://itecounsel.com/SIT40516/course\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">IV in Commercial Cookery</a>. With this accredited qualification, you will be more skilled and counted as a professional commercial cook. You can get hired as a personal chef in Australia and other nearby states with this <a href=\"https://itecounsel.com/rpl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">RPL qualification</a> in any cooking industry.</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Direct Food Business Opportunity</strong></h3>\r\n<p>If you are ready to make a big move, then you can <a href=\"https://itecounsel.com/blog/how-to-start-a-food-business-from-home-in-australia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">open a food business</a> in your area. Rather than work for any other kitchen, you can start your food business from your kitchen. Maybe you can struggle at the beginning of your start-up, but it is best to join a direct sales business opportunity from the home restaurant or food cart.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Be a Food Blogger</strong></h3>\r\n<p><strong><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/WhatsApp Image 2021-11-02 at 10.39.51 AM.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"676\" height=\"450\" /></strong></p>\r\n<p>You can become a media sensation in the online food market with your passion for food blogging. Nowadays, many people are earning money with cooking videos and doing food reviews via online streaming. Becoming a food influencer is not a joke unless you have enough knowledge and presentable skills. Most of the restaurants are now depending on food bloggers. So, you have such platforms to show your interest in food; even you can promote your cooking skills too.</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Home Catering Service</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Many people are now starting house catering services from their house. Especially, women are pretty interested in this easy-going catering business setup. As many companies and organizations totally depend on daily meal services, including home catering. You need to cook daily according to order for an excellent earning flow. Taking orders, cooking, and delivering them on time will be your job.</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Cooking Contest</strong></h3>\r\n<p>More or less, if you are confident enough with an excellent cook quality and experience with outnumbering of cooking skills. Then you can get participated in any national and international cooking contest. Showing your affection for cooking can lead you to reach your ultimate goal of becoming a world-class chef and earning fame. So, never miss the chance to attend any cooking competition based on your preferences.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Bakery and Cake Business</strong></h3>\r\n<p><strong><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/WhatsApp Image 2021-11-02 at 10.39.50 AM.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"677\" height=\"451\" /></strong></p>\r\n<p>Everybody loves cookies and pastries to eat all day long. But what if you can pull this business from your place where your customers can get fresh homemade cookies and cakes. It is a great business and a platform to show your creativity for customized food items. Along with those, you can showcase various sweet items in your list too. No matter what, homemade bakery items are always best, and no need to struggle much to run your <a href=\"https://itecounsel.com/blog/how-to-start-a-bakery-and-steps-to-open-a-bakery-business-in-australia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">bakery business</a>.</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Food Journalist and Photographer</strong></h3>\r\n<p>In Australia, there are few <a href=\"https://en.ejo.ch/specialist-journalism/how-to-be-a-food-journalist-curiosity-adjectives-and-cronuts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">food journalists</a> who are highly recommended to inspect restaurants and other cooking events. To become a food journalist, you just need to have outstanding qualifications and certified degrees. Showing passionate love and dedication to cooking and food items will let you become a great food journalist. Perhaps, to become a food photographer, photography skills should be magnificent level as the demand for food photographers is enormous in the job market.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><strong>Final Terms</strong></h2>\r\n<p>It is not that much tough to earn money with your skills and knowledge while you have vast cooking passions. All you have to do is push a little further to build a platform to generate your earnings while sitting at your home. Till now, we have covered various opportunities to make your cooking love into your profession. So, <a href=\"https://itecounsel.com/hospitality-industry/industry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">choose your preferred one</a> and lead the cooking industry by earning money with your hard work.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, NULL, 'Make Money by Showing Your Love for Cooking', 'how-to-make-money-by-showing-your-love-for-cooking.jpeg', 'how-to-make-money-by-showing-your-love-for-cooking.jpeg', 'How to Make Money by Showing Your Love for Cooking?', 'Make Money by Showing Your Love for Cooking', 1, '2021-11-01 22:42:28', '2021-11-01 22:45:03');
INSERT INTO `blogs` (`id`, `action_user`, `blog_categories_id`, `blog_title`, `blog_slug`, `blog_des`, `meta_des`, `meta_tags`, `meta_keys`, `image`, `thumbnail`, `image_alt`, `thumbnail_alt`, `isPublished`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(38, 1, 4, 'What Are The Duties and Responsibilities of a Makeup Artist?', 'what-are-the-duties-and-responsibilities-of-a-makeup-artist', '<p>Showing your interest in the beauty industry, you can blend into different professions. Like, hairdressers, beauty therapists, remedial massages, makeup artists, and so on other sectors. Like this, a makeup artist is responsible for giving consulting the clients and providing custom looks depending on their specifications. Even they have to maintain various jobs responsibilities according to the demands and schedules. A makeup artist is well knowledgeable and suitable for multiple beautifying tasks, including color palettes application, put trendy makeup design, and giving products, materials, and color suggestions as per the client\'s skin tone.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/pexels-anthony-shkraba-5178004 (1).jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"426\" /></p>\r\n<p>Makeup artists are meant to stay updated on the latest trends in fashion and beauty and to create unique designs for customers. This profession is very much suitable for creative thinkers and individuals. If you are looking to become a well-known makeup artist in your country, you must know the duties and responsibilities of a makeup artist and the <a href=\"../../beauty-health/industry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">basic requirements</a> for this suitable position.</p>\r\n<p><br /><br /></p>\r\n<p><strong>What is a Makeup Artist? </strong></p>\r\n<p>A makeup artist is an exemplary art practitioner who contributes to general makeup services and offers clients prosthetic designs. A makeup artist is reliable in making visual transformations of people\'s appearance through makeup, tint, wigs set, and other accessories. The primary duties include enhancing facial shape through makeup and creating custom looks for clients. According to brightness, setting, and natural facial features, beauty artists apply complex and straightforward makeup as the client requires to meet their needs.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Makeup Artist Salary </strong><a href=\"https://www.payscale.com/research/AU/Job=Makeup_Artist/Hourly_Rate\"><strong>Source</strong></a><strong> </strong></p>\r\n<p>With less than 1-year of experience, an entry-level Makeup Artist can expect to earn an average total compensation of AU$20.58 based on 12 salaries. An early or mid-level Makeup Artist with 1-9 years of experience receives an average pay of AU$26.11- AU$28 based on 50 salaries counts. A Professionally trained Makeup Artist who has over 10-19 years of experience earns an average total compensation of AU$27.00 or more based on 13 salaries. Perhaps, in their late-career, employees get average total compensation of AU$50.</p>\r\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/WhatsApp Image 2021-11-04 at 5.14.20 PM.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"665\" height=\"384\" /></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <em>(Those pay includes tips, bonus, and overtime wages)</em></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Makeup Artist Duties and Responsibilities&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/makeup artists.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"426\" /></strong></p>\r\n<p>As a makeup artist, you have to perform several tasks and need to obey those responsibilities onwards. You have to be an expert in those job lines and make your work perfectly conditioned from the client\'s end. So, we briefly discuss all those duties and responsibilities to become a makeup artist. In general, the makeup artist duties and responsibilities are to,&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Enhance facial aesthetics look through makeup and other necessary follow-ups.</li>\r\n<li>Consult with customers and design custom looks based on their terms and demands.</li>\r\n<li>Help in removing makeup and other accessories after using on film sets or shooting of the actors.</li>\r\n<li>Work with celebrities on movie or shooting sets and keep follow-up polishing after taking shots.</li>\r\n<li>Take lighting adjustments and setting into account when applying makeup and other essentials mopping materials.</li>\r\n<li>Decide which materials and colors are the most suitable to use. Also, suggest recommended products.</li>\r\n<li>Maintain to design FX prosthetics arts according to particular effects requirements and impacts.</li>\r\n<li>Accumulate with outfit designers, set architects, and hairstylists to ensure consistency need of the makeup.</li>\r\n<li>Know how to do color palettes and layout styles of makeup and facial out glow to deliver a good result.</li>\r\n<li>Keep an awareness of the latest trends and make your reach to the beauty industry. Continue to practice with advanced tools and quality materials.</li>\r\n<li>Perform with the models and fashion magazines as reference points as a good makeup artist.</li>\r\n<li>Understand to take the direction of a film director and make them like the character role as the director instructed to look.</li>\r\n<li>Vast knowledge about a diverse cosmetic toolkit and should be proficient at using them according to expertise.</li>\r\n<li>Give consulting to the clients on their skincare methods and provide important tips for their natural skincare routines.</li>\r\n<li>Operate every makeup art task and business terms; those all should be under the state\'s health and safety regulations.</li>\r\n<li>Interact with clients to learn what they seek by understanding the needs and wants where it gets easier to serve.</li>\r\n<li>Manage personal hygiene standards and ensure the health issues during the covid pandemic along with other skincare concerns.</li>\r\n<li>Equip the necessary supplies and equipment that are needed for the makeup artist for their jobs.</li>\r\n<li>Professionally applied makeup and, by the time, make the connection with the regular customers for a good relationship.</li>\r\n<li>Understand the requirements from the clients and help with the visual and technical standpoint support.</li>\r\n<li>Held to create prominent makeup with suitable hairstyling and assist in delivering various trendy or newest makeups for the promotional acts.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Makeup Artist Qualifications and Requirements </strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>To become a celebrity makeup artist, one may require to have excellent knowledge of makeup products and techniques for 5 years of activity.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Candidates must qualify for<a href=\"../../SHB30115/course\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Certificate III in Beauty service (SHB30115)</a> to grow more skills and qualities to become makeup artists.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>To get a makeup artist license, having <a href=\"../../rpl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Recognition of Prior Learning (RPL)</a> in <a href=\"../../SHB50115/course\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Diploma of Beauty Therapy (SHB50115)</a> will assist the candidate in earning.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>At least, one should have a qualification degree in bachelor of Art or any equivalent professional training certificate to get any intermediate makeup artist job.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>There need 2-4 years of experience in the beauty industry. Especially, should have proficiency with prosthetics and creativity for the film industry.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Ability to understand and consider the stylistic elements of cinema, such as lighting, toning, and doing contrast makeup of the presenters.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Paying attention to the detail of makeup lines and being responsive to the in-depth result of the sharpness and perfect polishing setting.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Having an imaginative mindset is one of the necessary soft skills to become a successful makeup artist around the world. All you have to do is expand your ideas about the modern beauty industry.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>One should maintain exceptional verbal communication, and listening skills along with the other interpersonal skills as those will lead to being an extraordinary artist.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Customer-oriented with a proactive and confident attitude having a technical understanding of theme sets, lighting, photography, styles, and dramatization of any shoot.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>But it is competent to get an exceptional understanding of makeup and hairdressing techniques for blending yourself anywhere with any beauty industry.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><br /><br /></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, NULL, 'RPL, Recognition of Prior Learning, Duties and Responsibilities of a Makeup Artist', '', 'duties-and-responsibilities-of-a-makeup-artistjpeg.jpeg', 'What Are The Duties and Responsibilities of a Makeup Artist?', 'Duties and Responsibilities of a Makeup Artist', 1, '2021-11-05 12:32:31', '2021-11-08 21:30:57'),
(39, 1, 4, 'Get The Best Job Opportunities in Cookery Industry: A-List of Cooking Profession', 'get-the-best-job-opportunities-in-cookery-industry-a-list-of-cooking-profession', '<p>Cooking is your passion, and you know passionate jobs are always best. Moreover, you always like to do experiments with your cooking skills and resulting in a great outcome. But only having experience and creative ideas won&rsquo;t let you go long. Along with that, starting a career as a cook may let you surf in a good position. To become an intermediate cook to a professional chef, you might need to focus on your cookery skills and step into a food career line.</p>\r\n<p>There are many different cookery jobs available in many food chain restaurants and independent cookery professions. The cookery business field is vast, and the best opportunities are roaming around to <a href=\"https://itecounsel.com/blog/a-complete-guide-to-commercial-cookery-course-steps-to-complete-rpl-qualifications\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">make proficiency in a cooking career</a>. Consequently, people from any age or gender are showing more interest in cookery businesses or occupations. If you are interested in knowing more about the cookery industry, what are the best job opportunities in cookery? Then simply read further to bloom your career in the cookery industry.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><strong>What are The Job Opportunities in Cookery Industry?</strong></h2>\r\n<p><strong><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/pexels-rene-asmussen-3217156 (1).jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"426\" /></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Restaurant Chef </strong></h3>\r\n<p>With your qualifications and career experience, you can become a restaurant chef or chief cook in a renowned hotel or restaurant. At least you should have 10-15 years of cooking experience to become one of the senior chefs for such platforms. Even some chefs are well trained in specialized areas, and they only hire for particular kitchens. From assistance cook to executive chef, saucier, or even you can be a food-grade manager in restaurants. The pay is well for such positions.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Online Cook Tutor </strong></h3>\r\n<p>Many people are showing more interest in online tutoring about food or bakery cooking. Also, they are doing great to provide cooking classes for their online fans or viewers. Considerably, the numbers are growing, and most of the famous cooks are also opening their online platforms to promote their cooking skills. Besides, they offer various cooking classes via online recording or by individual presence. Moreover, online cook tutors also earn a good amount of money from tutoring multiple cooking techniques and sharing food knowledge.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Personal Chef</strong></h3>\r\n<p><strong><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://itecounsel.com/public/blogImages/pexels-andrea-piacquadio-3771120.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"426\" /></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Acquiring proper qualifications and outstanding cooking skills, you can apply to become a personal chef for any government organization, mansions, corporate building, or any authorized kitchen chef for the country&rsquo;s royal people. Even many VIPs require to have a personal chef for their daily meals and program&rsquo;s food arrangements. However, becoming a personal chef is not easy. You should have excellent cooking skills and a dynamic portfolio to enter this career line as a private chef.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Event Caterer </strong></h3>\r\n<p>If you have outstanding management skills and add that part, you are also very much ambitious to make a good career line in cook. Becoming an event caterer is an excellent choice. To become an event food cook or chef can turn your personal working holding from one regular chef. Catering Chef is assigned to coordinate with preparation, delivering, and serving meals in order to meet client&rsquo;s demand based on the selective menu and event types. An event caterer is responsible for ensuring and providing a quality food menu to meet the expectation of the customer through advanced tastings and practice runs.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Baking and Pastry Chef </strong></h3>\r\n<p>It is a very fun-loving job to do baking or pastry. Just by following the recipes, show your creation to make sweets and savory pastries. Even making a family-size cake is a matter of hours for a pastry chef. Applying calculative skills and details focus, a baking chef can measure and mix the cookery ingredients to ensure high-grade items. A baking and pastry cook can make colorful and flavored pastries, cakes, pies, sweetbreads, and more to offer various sweets. Though they take order to make customize food items on request and requirements for the clients. You can earn Recognised of Prior Learning (RPL) in Certificate III in Cake and Pastry (FBP30317) to become a registered baker or cake decorator.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Cloud Catering Service </strong></h3>\r\n<p>Nowadays, many housewives and house ladies are pretty much interested in this <a href=\"https://trailapp.com/blog/the-ultimate-guide-to-cloud-kitchens\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">cloud catering business</a>. Within a short period, it becomes one of the most booming businesses around many cities and states of Australia. It is not very formative to construct a cloud catering business, and anyone can start this business from their place. Providing 1 or 2 meals for the exciting employees in corporate houses or office buildings is the primary goal of this catering service.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Recipe Developer </strong></h3>\r\n<p>Let&rsquo;s say you are very talented and very much focused on cooking. Moreover, you are well-qualified as the main chef for restaurants or almost going to retire from this job very recently. Then you might have enough potentiality to expand your food knowledge with others. Also, you love to experiment with new food items and note them as your best creation. So, one of the suitable positions for you is to turn to another phase of your career as a recipe developer.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Chocolatier </strong></h3>\r\n<p>If you are really into cooking, you must have excellent ideas about chocolate and other related items. Your prime duties are to make chocolate and leverage the essential production skills, including tempering, dipping, molding, decorating, and sculpting. Professional qualification is recommended to become a well-known chocolatier. To shine in the cookery business and fulfill the chocolate shelf,&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Line Cook </strong></h3>\r\n<p>You never know what can bring you from a line cook or assistant chef. This is an intermediate job as a restaurant chef. The primary duties of a line cook are to help and assist the sous chef and the main chef while preparing ingredients and tracking all the dishes are prepared as per the customer&rsquo;s order. Sometimes line cook is in charge of maintaining restaurant standards and customer specifications under the policies. To become a line cook, along with vast cooking knowledge, there should be interpersonal skills like creativity, time management, active listening, and well-organized skills.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2><strong>Conclusion </strong></h2>\r\n<p>You can blend into any cookery job by collecting formal education and training in cooking techniques and pastry arts. Some restaurants require to have an associate or bachelor&rsquo;s degree in cooking according to the job positions. Having a <a href=\"https://itecounsel.com/rpl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Recognition of Prior Learning (RPL)</a> <a href=\"https://itecounsel.com/SIT30816/course\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Certificate III in Commercial Cookery (SIT30816)</a> will give you preferences for cookery job opportunities in Australia. At the same time, you can learn complete hands-on training and earn a minimum amount of money in the apprenticeships until you are qualified as a professional cook.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 'best-job-opportunities-in-cookery-industry.jpeg', 'Get The Best Job Opportunities in Cookery Industry: A-List of Cooking Profession', 'Best Job Opportunities in Cookery Industry', 1, '2021-11-17 20:59:48', '2021-11-17 21:26:04'),
(40, 1, 4, 'What Are the Reasons Being a Makeup Artist is Amazing?', 'what-are-the-reasons-being-a-makeup-artist-is-amazing', '<p>Reasons being a makeup artist say more than the shiny careers. It is also not all about face makeup. It is a vast area of creative works now. Again, having a passion for something and turning it into a career is fun. So, passionate makeup artists always inspire us giving numerous reasons. Whether you are choosing a course or career, knowing the reasons is beneficial.</p>\r\n<p>Does makeup stand for Mask? No. Makeup is to show different expressions through art. We can find several historical records of using makeup. These indicate that people have been fond of makeup for years for different reasons. Today, makeup artists are in the most demandable positions. Creative artists have discovered many styles with time. That is why they grab the makeup lover&rsquo;s attention frequently.<br /><br /></p>\r\n<h3><strong>Top 10 Reasons Being A Makeup Artist Is Amazing</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Let&rsquo;s discuss the fascinating reasons being a makeup artist is amazing-</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Be Creative at Work</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Being a makeup artist, you are free to experiment and show uniqueness. A creative artist paints a face like a canvas. Every artist is different; they think differently. So, we get to see reflections of new ideas through makeup.</p>\r\n<p>An artist has the chance to be creative on different platforms. They perform on seasonal trends, weddings, and other festive occasions. You can enjoy your works while getting more skilled. Your creativity will enable you to understand clients&rsquo; needs. Thus, you can create a particular group of clients who will love your confidence. And you will gather more knowledge.<br /><br /></p>\r\n<h3><strong>Create Popularity with Skills</strong></h3>\r\n<p>The makeup trends and styles change with time. But, if you are a passionate artist, you can keep pace with the changes. Your specific skills will attract people and bring you fame.</p>\r\n<p>There are many famous makeup artists in the fashion world. Every celebrity has a particular artist. Laura Mercier, Bobbi Brown, Pat McGrath, Richard Taylor, etc., are internationally famous experts. They all have gained popularity for their contribution to the makeup world. Becoming familiar is one of the fascinating reasons being a makeup artist is enjoyable.<br /><br /></p>\r\n<h3><strong>Recognised Qualified Artists </strong></h3>\r\n<p>The profession of a makeup artist is more valuable if you are certified. Yes, people seek qualified persons in this artistic profession also. Many courses include diplomas, are available in big countries. For example- Some Australian institute offers approved courses for experienced artists. You can take a Recognitions of Prior Learning (RPL) Certificate III in Make-Up (SHB30215).</p>\r\n<p>A recognized training helps makeup artists in many steps in their careers. It helps to gain customers&rsquo; trust and start your own business confidently. So, a particular qualification gives benefits. And, being a qualified artist, these benefits will increase your confidence. <br /><br /></p>\r\n<h3><strong>Be A Self-employed Person</strong></h3>\r\n<p>If you are a makeup artist, then you can start your business anytime. A salon or parlor will become your identity. You feel free, create your own rules, have the stuff of your choice.</p>\r\n<p>Besides a shop, you can do other freelance works. You choose to serve your clients on any occasion at any time. Attending job-related events, giving time to your website are all essential to expand your skills. And, these all are possible for a self-employed artist. So, being a self-employed makeup artist is more fun.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Cheap Start-up Cost</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Are you tensed about the expense? Well, the cost is cheap for a freelancer artist. You have to make a firm decision, and you can do it right away. Any makeup artist has the necessary makeup tools and kits. So, a start-up is easy.</p>\r\n<p>However, set-up a shop is also possible with little capital. You can invest a small amount in decorating a new shop. With time and skills, the business will grow without any tension. <br /><br /></p>\r\n<h3><strong>Stress-free Job</strong></h3>\r\n<p>This is true that if you enjoy your job, then you won&rsquo;t feel tension. But, there are many jobs or responsibilities which put people under pressure. Compared with others, the makeup works are pressure-free.</p>\r\n<p>A makeup artist&rsquo;s skills, passion make the job relaxing. You got love for your work; you can have fun. There is no heavy physical task. Again, artists can choose to do indoor works they want. And flexing working hours is another thing that makes this profession stress-free. You may have e hectic week, but you also take a break the following week. So, choosing a working schedule according to your interest is an advantage.<br /><br /></p>\r\n<h3><strong>Expand Your Network</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Makeup artists get opportunities to meet different people often. From middle-class to different high-profile clients visit a makeup artist. Thus, building links and spreading your expertise is not a big deal.</p>\r\n<p>Robust networks are necessary to get top projects. You know that artists work on occasions and attend programs. Meeting influential people help to grow your network and also makes you social and relaxed.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Handsome Earning</strong></h3>\r\n<p>The beauty industry is booming day by day. Along with the endless opportunity of works the salary ranges are also noticeable. It goes without saying how good a celebrity&rsquo;s makeup artist earns per year.</p>\r\n<p>The modern world has a huge demand for a makeup artist role. However, you have to keep polishing your creativity for a better income. Every person dream of getting a job in the top salary range. And, getting paid for your passion is interesting. But don&rsquo;t forget to be a hard worker.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Get Discounts on Makeup Products</strong></h3>\r\n<p>This is interesting! Being a makeup artist, you will enjoy product discounts and even free products sometimes. As a regular customer, you will enjoy many types of discounts.</p>\r\n<p>Besides, there are various brands out there, and they want to raise their brand name. If you are a famous artist, the big brands will promote their products through you. Then you can always get makeup kits at discounts.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3><strong>&nbsp;Make Someone Happy</strong></h3>\r\n<p>The Last and touchy reason to become a makeup artist is to see people happy. We want to look beautiful in front of the mirror. Beautiful looks, nice compliments help people to stay positive and confident.</p>\r\n<p>A makeup artist plays a vital role in making a person smile. Only the delicate makeup, creative work and, complete finishing can do this. Every bride dream of her gorgeous wedding day look. And only an experienced makeup artist can make her dream come true. Happiness is priceless! Making someone happy is among the best reasons being a makeup artist is amazing.</p>\r\n<p><br /><br /></p>\r\n<p>So, be that fantastic makeup artist, help people to enhance their beauty.</p>', 'Makeup artist jobs have huge value. And the reasons are fascinating.', NULL, 'Reasons Being a Makeup Artist', '', 'reasons-being-a-makeup-artist.jpg', 'What Are the Reasons Being a Makeup Artist is Amazing?', 'What Are the Reasons Being a Makeup Artist is Amazing?', 1, '2021-11-19 12:55:37', '2021-11-19 23:39:24'),
(42, 1, 6, 'Best Tips to Make an Excellent Career with A Hospitality Course in Australia', 'best-tips-to-make-an-excellent-career-with-a-hospitality-course-in-australia', '<p>Some essential tips to make an excellent career with a hospitality course are many. Since it\'s a booming and extremely profitable sector, interested persons seek tips to become successful. In this broad area, there are many job types available. Food, beverage, hotel management, tourism, and so many lucrative areas have career opportunities. Those who have skills get good prospects in the hospitality job field.</p>\r\n<p>There are two divisions in the hospitality industry- the operational division and the corporate division. According to skills, experience, qualification, and specialization choice, you can choose a job hospitality sector.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Six Important Tips to Make an Excellent Career with A Hospitality Course </strong></p>\r\n<p>Proficiency is necessary to make an excellent career in the dynamic field of hospitality. But you need to have a recognized certificate to qualify for the most demanding jobs. For example- The Recognition of Prior Learning (RPL) accredited course of Certificate III in Hospitality (SIT3061) is greatly valued in Australia. Employers offer attractive salaries to these qualified experts.</p>\r\n<p>However, following some tips or steps may ease the path of success for a skilled person with a hospitality course. Below are six applicable tips for those &ndash;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Identify Why You Want to Work in Hospitality Field? </strong></p>\r\n<p>Hospitality stands for helpfulness. So, willingness to offer help and welcome your customers with complete patience is important. There are different job sectors in the hospitality field. And, every area is related to providing friendliness. That is why you have to know your passion and patience for the work.</p>\r\n<p>As we know, hard work is the key to success. Similarly, if you identify why a position attracts you, it is helpful to gain success. It also encourages you to do much hard work in your chosen field. So, if you want to build a career in the hospitality sector, find the reasons and go ahead accordingly.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Find Your Specialisation Field </strong></p>\r\n<p>Consider the differences between getting a job and opportunities to work in a big industry. The hospitality industry is broad, so getting that key opportunity is not so easy. You must have to select your choice of field to get a head-start. It will help you to nurture your dream while saving valuable time.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Some job positions in the hospitality sector are- </strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Hotel manager </strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Senior bar attendant </strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Accommodation manager </strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Catering manager </strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Guest service agent </strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Conference center manager </strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Event manager </strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Fast food restaurant manager </strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Public house manager </strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Espresso coffee machine operator </strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Food and beverage attendant </strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Front desk receptionist </strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Function attendant </strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Function host </strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Gaming attendant </strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Housekeeper </strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Restaurant host or waiter</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>However, a person cannot be an expert in all areas. Selecting a particular field helps to target one goal. Thus, you can follow the necessary steps to sharpen your skills. You will make unique skills that allow you to become more confident. For instance, if you want to be a p&acirc;tissier, you only need to find ways to lead you to that goal. The ways include relevant qualifications, experiences, skills, etc. In Australia, the RPL course SIT31016 Certificate III in Patisserie is greatly appreciated in this regard. The fact is, after pursuing a Certificate III in Hospitality, you can do this patisserie course again to make a fixed goal. It will provide you with proper guidelines and would be much profitable for career advancement.</p>\r\n<p>Again, finding a particular sector saves time while lessening unnecessary tensions. When you know your target job sector, you don\'t have to apply for jobs randomly. So, one must consider selecting a niche specialization to achieve the desired success in the hospitality field.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Take Necessary Training&nbsp; </strong></p>\r\n<p>Don\'t limit yourself within the college-provided knowledge. If you think those knowledge or existing experiences are enough, it will be impossible to pursue a higher position. Professionally, there are so many things to learn and, it is also true for the hospitality sector.</p>\r\n<p>Yes, you should not underestimate the initial learnings as well as the part-time jobs. But, taking more advanced training is helpful. Studying the top industries\' requirements and competitors always helps to find your abilities and lackings. And, thus you will know which trainings are necessary. Moreover, planning for further study is also a path to get your foot in the door. So, don\'t hesitate to take part in essential learning sessions.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Sell Yourself</strong></p>\r\n<p>To see yourself on the pick of your dream position, you must bracket your unique point. Yes, gaining the necessary knowledge is not enough. You have to show your understandings in the workplace and thus recognize your specialty. It plays a significant role in setting you apart while indicating your comprehensive plan for a hospitality career.</p>\r\n<p>So, having individuality helps much to sell yourself. Be a smart worker, concentrate on building leadership capability, IT skills, negotiation skills, and other relevant things to discover your unique power.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Involve in More Social Activities</strong></p>\r\n<p>Socialization is an integral part of achieving comfort in the area of hospitality. It doesn\'t matter which specialization interest you have; networking is everything. It allows you to be more social. You can remain active in virtual social media, physically participate in social events, job fairs, etc. Chances are also there during any learning session, job, or internship.</p>\r\n<p>As the hospitality sector is thoroughly affected by social trends, social platforms also help you understand customer behavior. Not only that, the valuable contacts you make through social activities increase your knowledge in many ways. The process brings opportunities for better career options, learning ideas, and motivates you to become a leader.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Don\'t Be Afraid to Travel</strong></p>\r\n<p>As a beginner, never miss to grab any of the opportunities, whether it\'s small or big. Also, stacking in one place is neither a good decision. Don\'t be afraid to move till you get there. In this vast area of hospitality, you may be required to change cities, companies, and colleagues as well. Consider these changes positively, work hard, and explore the emerging market. It will broaden your area experiences with many lessons too.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Conclusion</strong></p>\r\n<p>Wrapping up the valuable tips, remember that the global hospitality sector is vast and competitive. If you dream of shaping a career in any hospitality sector, there is no shortcut path. Following the steps, one by one will equip you with essential skills. So, do your study before choosing a fixed field, then follow these tips to make an excellent career with a hospitality course.</p>', 'Everyone seeks for tips to become a gainer in professional fields. We will discuss such interesting Tips to make an excellent career with a hospitality course.', NULL, 'Tips to make an excellent career with a hospitality course', '', 'best-tips-to-make-an-excellent-career-with-a-hospitality-course-in-australia.jpg', 'Best Tips to Make an Excellent Career with A Hospitality Course in Australia', 'Best Tips to Make an Excellent Career with A Hospitality Course in Australia', 1, '2021-11-29 04:07:56', '2021-11-29 04:07:56');

